esume` | 查询并接管 orphaned issue |\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. claim 失败时返回可领取 issue 列表。\n2. fix 阶段如果 issue blocked，则提示依赖链。\n3. session-bind/unbind/status/resume 输出适合终端阅读。\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_f0e95b3db0264ad0983206cd","duration_ms":14}
