[2026-05-24 15:16:00] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\07-skill-integration.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\07-skill-integration.md","content":"# 模块 7：Skill 集成\n\n> 阶段：M6 | 依赖：M3（Issue 镜像）/ M4（Session 注册中心）\n> 来源于统一需求 FR-8\n\n## 目标\n\n现有 Issue 工作流 Skill 需要调用本地服务，实现 claim/fix/pr 前的状态检查和 session 绑定。\n\n## 集成点\n\n| Skill/命令 | 集成点 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `003-4-issue-claim` | claim 前查 `/issues/{id}` 和 `/sessions`，成功后绑定 session |\n| `003-5-issue-fix` | 开始前查依赖，done 时更新 issue last_activity 和 session 状态 |\n| `003-6-issue-pr` | PR 前查 issue 状态、rebase 状态、Test Plan |\n| `/session-bind` | 显式绑定当前 Session 到 Issue |\n| `/session-unbind` | 显式解绑 |\n| `/session-status` | 查询当前 Session |\n| `/session-resume` | 查询并接管 orphaned issue |\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. claim 失败时返回可领取 issue 列表。\n2. fix 阶段如果 issue blocked，则提示依赖链。\n3. session-bind/unbind/status/resume 输出适合终端阅读。\n","numLines":27,"startLine":1,"totalLines":27}},"tool_use_id":"call_cc52c00cae2240d9bb49a70c","duration_ms":10}
