[2026-05-24 15:16:00] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\04-session-registry.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\04-session-registry.md","content":"# 模块 4：Session 注册中心\n\n> 阶段：M4 | 依赖：M3（Issue 状态镜像）\n> 来源于统一需求 FR-5\n\n## 目标\n\n本地服务维护 Claude Code Session、Agent 和 Issue 的绑定关系。\n\n## Session 模型\n\n```text\nSession\n- session_id\n- agent_id\n- issue_number nullable\n- branch\n- cwd\n- status: active / idle / ended / orphaned\n- started_at\n- last_heartbeat_at\n- ended_at nullable\n```\n\n## API\n\n| 方法 | 路径 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `POST` | `/sessions/register` | 注册 Session |\n| `POST` | `/sessions/{id}/bind` | 绑定 Issue |\n| `POST` | `/sessions/{id}/unbind` | 解绑 Issue |\n| `POST` | `/sessions/{id}/heartbeat` | 更新心跳 |\n| `POST` | `/sessions/{id}/end` | 注销并生成交接 |\n| `GET` | `/sessions` | 查询所有 Session |\n| `GET` | `/sessions/{id}` | 查询单个 Session |\n| `GET` | `/sessions/orphaned` | 查询可接管遗留任务 |\n\n## 自动绑定规则\n\n1. SessionStart Hook 自动注册 Session，并读取当前分支。\n2. 分支名匹配 `issue-<N>`、`fix/issue-<N>-*`、`feat/issue-<N>-*` 时自动绑定 Issue #N。\n3. Stop Hook 发送 heartbeat。\n4. SessionEnd Hook 注销 Session；如果 issue 未完成，生成交接摘要。\n5. 超过 60 分钟无心跳的 Session 标记为 orphaned。\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. 启动 Claude Code 时输出 SessionID、AgentID、绑定状态。\n2. 同一 issue 被多个 active Session 绑定时输出警告，但默认不阻断。\n3. orphaned Session 可被 `/sessions/orphaned` 查询。\n4. 正常结束但 issue 未完成时生成 `doc/otherDoc/handoff/<issue-number>.md`。\n","numLines":52,"startLine":1,"totalLines":52}},"tool_use_id":"call_78c281fe77aa4126815ad92d","duration_ms":3}
