llect\n\n# 扫描所有项目\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --all\n\n# 只看不写\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --dry-run\n```\n\n### session-find\n\n```bash\n# 按项目查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk\n\n# 按机器查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A\n\n# 按分支查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --branch feat/issue-27\n\n# 按 session_id 查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123\n\n# 组合\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --machine machine-A\n```\n\n### 输出示例\n\n```text\n$ claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk\n\nSESSION_ID   MACHINE     CWD                                     BRANCH          FILE_PATH\nabc123       WIN-DEV     D:\\Code\\claude-hk                       feat/issue-27   C:\\Users\\x\\.claude\\projects\\D--Code-claude-hk\\abc123.jsonl\ndef456       WIN-DEV     D:\\Code\\claude-hk                       main            C:\\Users\\x\\.claude\\projects\\D--Code-claude-hk\\def456.jsonl\nghi789       MAC-PRO     /Users/x/code/claude-hk                 main            /Users/x/.claude/projects/-Users-x-code-claude-hk/ghi789.jsonl\n```\n\n## 收集流程\n\n```text\nsession-collect\n  │\n  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname）\n  │\n  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/ 下所有子目录\n  │     每个 {slug}/ 目录下找 .jsonl 文件\n  │\n  ├── 3. 对每个 .jsonl 文件：\n  │     ├── session_id = 文件名去掉 .jsonl\n  │     ├── slug = 父目录名\n  │     ├── file_path = 完整绝对路径\n  │     └── 试着从 .jsonl 首尾读 branch / ts（失败就留空）\n  │\n  ├── 4. 反推项目信息：\n  │     slug 里编码了路径 → 尝试还原成 cwd\n  │     在 cwd 目录下执行 git remote → 得到 project\n  │     （如果目录不存在或不是 git 仓库，project 留空）\n  │\n  ├── 5. UPSERT 到 SQLite\n  │\n  └── 6. 输出：扫描 N 个文件，新增 X 条，更新 Y 条\n```\n\n## 明确不做的事\n\n| 不做 | 原因 |\n|------|------|\n| 不复制/搬运 session 文件 | Claude Code 自己管理，不需要我们动 |\n| 不修改 .jsonl 内容 | 原始数据不可变 |\n| 不修改 ~/.claude/ 下任何文件 | 不干预 Claude Code |\n| 不做 session 恢复/resume | 只记录位置，不负责使用 |\n| 不做 heartbeat/状态追踪 | 只记录静态信息 |\n| 不与 issue 绑定 | 独立功能 |\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. `session-collect` 扫描后，每条记录能回答：哪台机器、哪个项目、项目路径、session 文件路径。\n2. Claude Code 的 `~/.claude/` 目录内容未被修改（只读扫描）。\n3. `session-find` 按任意组合条件能查到对应记录。\n4. 重复执行 `session-collect` 不产生重复记录。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":20,"newStart":1,"newLines":30,"lines":[" # 模块 2：Session 索引记录"," ","-> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：M1（固定本地存储）","-> 2026-05-24 更新：从 Session 同步（push/pull/heartbeat）简化为纯索引记录。","+> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：无（可独立运行）","+> 2026-05-24 更新：纯只读索引，不碰 Claude Code 原始数据。"," ","-## 目标","+## 核心原则"," ","-扫描 `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` 下的 session 文件，提取核心定位信息写入 SQLite，支持按机器、项目、分支快速查找 session。","+**只读，不动 Claude Code 的任何东西。**"," ","-**不做的事：**","-- 不做 session 恢复/resume（不做 session-pull）","-- 不做 session 文件搬运（不做 session-push 的文件复制）","-- 不做 heartbeat/orphaned/active 状态追踪","-- 不做 session 与 issue 的绑定","+Claude Code 的 session 文件照常存在 `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` 下，`claude-tap-plus` 只做一件事："," ","-**只做一件事：索引 session 的位置信息，让你能快速找到它。**","+> 扫描这些文件，在 SQLite 里记一笔：哪台机器、哪个项目、项目在该机器上的路径、session_id。"," ","+不改、不搬、不删 Claude Code 的原始存储。","+","+## 你要回答的问题","+","+```","+session_id = abc123","+  → 哪台机器？         machine_id","+  → 哪个项目？         project (git remote repo name)","+  → 项目在机器上的路径？cwd (D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk)","+  → session 文件在哪？  file_path (~/.claude/projects/{slug}/abc123.jsonl)","+```","+","+就这些。其他信息（时间、分支、模型）是附带的，有更好，没有也行。","+"," ## SQLite 表结构"," "," ```sql"]},{"oldStart":22,"oldLines":121,"newStart":32,"newLines":73,"lines":["     session_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,","     machine_id   TEXT NOT NULL,","     project      TEXT NOT NULL,","-    git_remote   TEXT,","-    slug         TEXT NOT NULL,","     cwd          TEXT NOT NULL,","     file_path    TEXT NOT NULL,","-    file_size    INTEGER,","-    record_count INTEGER,","+    slug         TEXT NOT NULL,","     branch       TEXT,","-    models_used  TEXT,","     first_ts     TEXT,","     last_ts      TEXT,","     collected_at TEXT NOT NULL"," );","-","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_machine  ON session_index(machine_id);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_project  ON session_index(project);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_branch   ON session_index(branch);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_slug     ON session_index(slug);"," ```"," ","-## 字段说明","+字段精简到最小："," ","-| 字段 | 说明 | 来源 |","-|------|------|------|","-| `session_id` | Claude Code 的 session 标识 | 从 .jsonl 文件名提取 |","-| `machine_id` | 哪台电脑 | 本机 hostname 或配置 |","-| `project` | 项目名 | git remote repo name / cwd basename / `--tap-project` |","-| `git_remote` | git remote URL | `git remote get-url origin` |","-| `slug` | `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` 中的 slug | 从目录结构提取 |","-| `cwd` | 当时的工作目录 | slug 反推或从 .jsonl 内容提取 |","-| `file_path` | session .jsonl 文件的完整绝对路径 | 扫描结果 |","-| `file_size` | 文件大小（字节） | `os.Stat` |","-| `record_count` | JSONL 记录条数 | 逐行计数或估算 |","-| `branch` | 当时活跃的 git 分支 | 从 .jsonl 内容提取 |","-| `models_used` | 使用了哪些模型（逗号分隔） | 从 .jsonl 内容提取 |","-| `first_ts` | session 最早时间戳 | .jsonl 第一条记录 |","-| `last_ts` | session 最后时间戳 | .jsonl 最后一条记录 |","-| `collected_at` | 索引收集时间 | 当前时间 |","+| 字段 | 说明 | 为什么需要 |","+|------|------|-----------|","+| `session_id` | Claude Code session 标识 | 知道是哪个 session |","+| `machine_id` | 哪台电脑（hostname） | 知道在哪台机器上 |","+| `project` | 项目名（git remote repo name） | 知道是哪个项目 |","+| `cwd` | 项目在该机器上的路径 | 知道项目目录在哪 |","+| `file_path` | session .jsonl 的完整路径 | 直接找到 session 文件 |","+| `slug` | Claude Code 的 slug | 关联 cwd 和 file_path |","+| `branch` | 分支名（可选） | 附带信息 |","+| `first_ts` / `last_ts` | 时间范围（可选） | 附带信息 |","+| `collected_at` | 什么时候建的索引 | 知道索引是否过时 |"," ","-## 命令行接口","+## 命令"," "," ### session-collect"," ","-扫描 session 文件并写入索引：","-"," ```bash","-# 收集当前项目的 session","+# 扫描并建索引"," claude-tap-plus session-collect"," ","-# 收集所有项目的 session","+# 扫描所有项目"," claude-tap-plus session-collect --all"," ","-# 手动指定项目名","-claude-tap-plus session-collect --tap-project my-project","-","-# 只显示将收集内容，不写数据库","+# 只看不写"," claude-tap-plus session-collect --dry-run","-","-# 强制重新索引（清除旧索引再写入）","-claude-tap-plus session-collect --force"," ```"," "," ### session-find"," ","-按条件查询 session 索引：","-"," ```bash","-# 查找某个项目的所有 session","+# 按项目查"," claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk"," ","-# 查找某台机器的 session","+# 按机器查"," claude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A"," ","-# 查找某个分支的 session","+# 按分支查"," claude-tap-plus session-find --branch feat/issue-27"," ","-# 按 session_id 精确查找","+# 按 session_id 查"," claude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123"," ","-# 按 slug 查找（跨机器）","-claude-tap-plus session-find --slug D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk","-","-# 组合查询","-claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --branch main --machine machine-A","-","-# 输出详细文件信息","-claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --verbose","+# 组合","+claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --machine machine-A"," ```"," ","-### 输出格式","+### 输出示例"," ","-默认表格输出：","-"," ```text","-SESSION_ID          MACHINE     PROJECT     BRANCH           FIRST_TS              FILE_PATH","-abc123              machine-A   claude-hk   feat/issue-27    2026-05-24T10:00:00   ~/.claude/projects/.../abc123.jsonl","-def456              machine-A   claude-hk   main             2026-05-23T14:30:00   ~/.claude/projects/.../def456.jsonl","-```","+$ claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk"," ","-`--verbose` 输出：","-","-```text","-Session:    abc123","-Machine:    machine-A","-Project:    claude-hk","-Git Remote: https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk.git","-Slug:       D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk","-CWD:        D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","-File:       C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\abc123.jsonl","-Size:       1.2 MB","-Records:    345","-Branch:     feat/issue-27","-Models:     claude-sonnet-4-6, claude-opus-4-7","-First:      2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00","-Last:       2026-05-24T11:30:00+08:00","-Collected:  2026-05-24T12:00:00+08:00","+SESSION_ID   MACHINE     CWD                                     BRANCH          FILE_PATH","+abc123       WIN-DEV     D:\\Code\\claude-hk                       feat/issue-27   C:\\Users\\x\\.claude\\projects\\D--Code-claude-hk\\abc123.jsonl","+def456       WIN-DEV     D:\\Code\\claude-hk                       main            C:\\Users\\x\\.claude\\projects\\D--Code-claude-hk\\def456.jsonl","+ghi789       MAC-PRO     /Users/x/code/claude-hk                 main            /Users/x/.claude/projects/-Users-x-code-claude-hk/ghi789.jsonl"," ```"," "," ## 收集流程"]},{"oldStart":144,"oldLines":29,"newStart":106,"newLines":41,"lines":[" ```text"," session-collect","   │","-  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname 或配置）","-  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/{slug}/ 下所有 .jsonl 文件","-  ├── 3. 对每个文件提取：","-  │     ├── session_id（文件名去 .jsonl）","-  │     ├── slug（目录名）","-  │     ├── file_size","-  │     ├── record_count","-  │     ├── first_ts / last_ts（首尾记录）","-  │     ├── branch（从记录内容提取）","-  │     └── models_used（从记录内容提取）","-  ├── 4. 确定项目名：","-  │     ├── 优先：找 slug 对应的实际目录，读 git remote","-  │     ├── 其次：cwd basename","-  │     └── 手动：--tap-project","-  ├── 5. UPSERT 到 session_index 表","-  └── 6. 输出收集统计","+  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname）","+  │","+  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/ 下所有子目录","+  │     每个 {slug}/ 目录下找 .jsonl 文件","+  │","+  ├── 3. 对每个 .jsonl 文件：","+  │     ├── session_id = 文件名去掉 .jsonl","+  │     ├── slug = 父目录名","+  │     ├── file_path = 完整绝对路径","+  │     └── 试着从 .jsonl 首尾读 branch / ts（失败就留空）","+  │","+  ├── 4. 反推项目信息：","+  │     slug 里编码了路径 → 尝试还原成 cwd","+  │     在 cwd 目录下执行 git remote → 得到 project","+  │     （如果目录不存在或不是 git 仓库，project 留空）","+  │","+  ├── 5. UPSERT 到 SQLite","+  │","+  └── 6. 输出：扫描 N 个文件，新增 X 条，更新 Y 条"," ```"," ","+## 明确不做的事","+","+| 不做 | 原因 |","+|------|------|","+| 不复制/搬运 session 文件 | Claude Code 自己管理，不需要我们动 |","+| 不修改 .jsonl 内容 | 原始数据不可变 |","+| 不修改 ~/.claude/ 下任何文件 | 不干预 Claude Code |","+| 不做 session 恢复/resume | 只记录位置，不负责使用 |","+| 不做 heartbeat/状态追踪 | 只记录静态信息 |","+| 不与 issue 绑定 | 独立功能 |","+"," ## 验收标准"," ","-1. `session-collect` 能扫描当前机器所有 session 并写入 SQLite 索引。","-2. `session-collect --dry-run` 只展示计划收集内容，不写数据库。","-3. `session-find --project X` 返回该项目的所有 session。","-4. `session-find --machine X --branch Y` 组合查询正常工作。","-5. 每条记录能快速定位到：哪台机器、哪个项目、哪个 slug、session 文件的完整路径。","-6. 重复执行 `session-collect` 不会产生重复记录（UPSERT）。","+1. `session-collect` 扫描后，每条记录能回答：哪台机器、哪个项目、项目路径、session 文件路径。","+2. Claude Code 的 `~/.claude/` 目录内容未被修改（只读扫描）。","+3. `session-find` 按任意组合条件能查到对应记录。","+4. 重复执行 `session-collect` 不产生重复记录。"]}],"originalFile":"# 模块 2：Session 索引记录\n\n> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：M1（固定本地存储）\n> 2026-05-24 更新：从 Session 同步（push/pull/heartbeat）简化为纯索引记录。\n\n## 目标\n\n扫描 `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` 下的 session 文件，提取核心定位信息写入 SQLite，支持按机器、项目、分支快速查找 session。\n\n**不做的事：**\n- 不做 session 恢复/resume（不做 session-pull）\n- 不做 session 文件搬运（不做 session-push 的文件复制）\n- 不做 heartbeat/orphaned/active 状态追踪\n- 不做 session 与 issue 的绑定\n\n**只做一件事：索引 session 的位置信息，让你能快速找到它。**\n\n## SQLite 表结构\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE session_index (\n    session_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    machine_id   TEXT NOT NULL,\n    project      TEXT NOT NULL,\n    git_remote   TEXT,\n    slug         TEXT NOT NULL,\n    cwd          TEXT NOT NULL,\n    file_path    TEXT NOT NULL,\n    file_size    INTEGER,\n    record_count INTEGER,\n    branch       TEXT,\n    models_used  TEXT,\n    first_ts     TEXT,\n    last_ts      TEXT,\n    collected_at TEXT NOT NULL\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_machine  ON session_index(machine_id);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_project  ON session_index(project);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_branch   ON session_index(branch);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_slug     ON session_index(slug);\n```\n\n## 字段说明\n\n| 字段 | 说明 | 来源 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `session_id` | Claude Code 的 session 标识 | 从 .jsonl 文件名提取 |\n| `machine_id` | 哪台电脑 | 本机 hostname 或配置 |\n| `project` | 项目名 | git remote repo name / cwd basename / `--tap-project` |\n| `git_remote` | git remote URL | `git remote get-url origin` |\n| `slug` | `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` 中的 slug | 从目录结构提取 |\n| `cwd` | 当时的工作目录 | slug 反推或从 .jsonl 内容提取 |\n| `file_path` | session .jsonl 文件的完整绝对路径 | 扫描结果 |\n| `file_size` | 文件大小（字节） | `os.Stat` |\n| `record_count` | JSONL 记录条数 | 逐行计数或估算 |\n| `branch` | 当时活跃的 git 分支 | 从 .jsonl 内容提取 |\n| `models_used` | 使用了哪些模型（逗号分隔） | 从 .jsonl 内容提取 |\n| `first_ts` | session 最早时间戳 | .jsonl 第一条记录 |\n| `last_ts` | session 最后时间戳 | .jsonl 最后一条记录 |\n| `collected_at` | 索引收集时间 | 当前时间 |\n\n## 命令行接口\n\n### session-collect\n\n扫描 session 文件并写入索引：\n\n```bash\n# 收集当前项目的 session\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect\n\n# 收集所有项目的 session\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --all\n\n# 手动指定项目名\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --tap-project my-project\n\n# 只显示将收集内容，不写数据库\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --dry-run\n\n# 强制重新索引（清除旧索引再写入）\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --force\n```\n\n### session-find\n\n按条件查询 session 索引：\n\n```bash\n# 查找某个项目的所有 session\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk\n\n# 查找某台机器的 session\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A\n\n# 查找某个分支的 session\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --branch feat/issue-27\n\n# 按 session_id 精确查找\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123\n\n# 按 slug 查找（跨机器）\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --slug D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\n\n# 组合查询\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --branch main --machine machine-A\n\n# 输出详细文件信息\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk --verbose\n```\n\n### 输出格式\n\n默认表格输出：\n\n```text\nSESSION_ID          MACHINE     PROJECT     BRANCH           FIRST_TS              FILE_PATH\nabc123              machine-A   claude-hk   feat/issue-27    2026-05-24T10:00:00   ~/.claude/projects/.../abc123.jsonl\ndef456              machine-A   claude-hk   main             2026-05-23T14:30:00   ~/.claude/projects/.../def456.jsonl\n```\n\n`--verbose` 输出：\n\n```text\nSession:    abc123\nMachine:    machine-A\nProject:    claude-hk\nGit Remote: https://github.com/xiaoheiDTF/claude-hk.git\nSlug:       D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\nCWD:        D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\nFile:       C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\abc123.jsonl\nSize:       1.2 MB\nRecords:    345\nBranch:     feat/issue-27\nModels:     claude-sonnet-4-6, claude-opus-4-7\nFirst:      2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00\nLast:       2026-05-24T11:30:00+08:00\nCollected:  2026-05-24T12:00:00+08:00\n```\n\n## 收集流程\n\n```text\nsession-collect\n  │\n  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname 或配置）\n  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/{slug}/ 下所有 .jsonl 文件\n  ├── 3. 对每个文件提取：\n  │     ├── session_id（文件名去 .jsonl）\n  │     ├── slug（目录名）\n  │     ├── file_size\n  │     ├── record_count\n  │     ├── first_ts / last_ts（首尾记录）\n  │     ├── branch（从记录内容提取）\n  │     └── models_used（从记录内容提取）\n  ├── 4. 确定项目名：\n  │     ├── 优先：找 slug 对应的实际目录，读 git remote\n  │     ├── 其次：cwd basename\n  │     └── 手动：--tap-project\n  ├── 5. UPSERT 到 session_index 表\n  └── 6. 输出收集统计\n```\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. `session-collect` 能扫描当前机器所有 session 并写入 SQLite 索引。\n2. `session-collect --dry-run` 只展示计划收集内容，不写数据库。\n3. `session-find --project X` 返回该项目的所有 session。\n4. `session-find --machine X --branch Y` 组合查询正常工作。\n5. 每条记录能快速定位到：哪台机器、哪个项目、哪个 slug、session 文件的完整路径。\n6. 重复执行 `session-collect` 不会产生重复记录（UPSERT）。\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_ae82837f486f4c7b8cca3fa0","duration_ms":11}
