[2026-05-24 18:34:16] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.16-data-flow.md","content":"# 3.16 数据流转\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §5\n\n## 5.1 Proxy Trace 数据流\n\n```text\nClaude Code API 请求\n  -> Local Proxy\n  -> Upstream API\n  -> Local Proxy\n  -> SSE Reassembler\n  -> Usage Normalizer\n  -> Trace Writer\n  -> 固定存储 traces/\n  -> Session/Usage 查询\n```\n\n## 5.2 Session 数据流\n\n**Collect（只读索引）：**\n\n```text\nClaude 原始 session\n  -> session-collect 只读扫描\n  -> Session Index\n  -> Local DB\n  -> session-find 查询\n```\n\n**Import（外部导入）：**\n\n```text\n外部 trace/session\n  -> session-import\n  -> 固定存储 imports/traces/sessions\n  -> Session Index\n  -> Local DB\n```\n\n**Snapshot（快照同步）：**\n\n```text\nClaude 原始 session\n  -> session-push\n  -> 本地快照 sessions/\n  -> session-status\n  -> session-pull\n  -> Claude 原始目录\n```\n\n## 5.3 Issue 数据流\n\n```text\nGitHub Issues\n  -> Issue Mirror sync/webhook\n  -> Local DB\n  -> /issues /board /ready\n  -> Hooks Guard / Skills / Scheduler\n  -> 用户显式动作或 scheduler 动作\n  -> GitHub\n  -> Issue Mirror 再同步\n```\n\n## 5.4 Sandbox 数据流\n\n```text\n用户命令 --sandbox branch\n  -> Project Resolver\n  -> Sandbox Manager\n  -> Git Worktree\n  -> Tool Adapter\n  -> Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae\n  -> sandbox worktree 文件变化\n  -> sandbox diff/status\n  -> 用户显式 apply/sync\n  -> 主项目或远端\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_5689cc33350f4714822dd32b"}
