[2026-05-24 18:34:17] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.17-sequences.md","content":"# 3.17 时序图合集\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §6-12\n\n## 6. 总体时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Storage as Storage Manager\n    participant Module as 目标模块\n\n    User->>CLI: 执行 claude-tap-plus 命令\n    CLI->>Project: 识别 project/cwd/git/branch/slug\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回项目身份\n    CLI->>Storage: 获取固定存储路径\n    Storage-->>CLI: 返回 db/trace/session/log 路径\n    CLI->>CLI: 解析命令模式\n    CLI->>Module: 调用目标功能\n    Module-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    CLI-->>User: 输出结果\n```\n\n## 7. Proxy Trace 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Proxy as Proxy Trace\n    participant Claude as Claude Code\n    participant API as 上游 API\n    participant SSE as SSE Reassembler\n    participant Usage as Usage Normalizer\n    participant Trace as Trace Writer\n\n    User->>CLI: claude-tap-plus claude\n    CLI->>Proxy: 启动本地代理\n    CLI->>Claude: 注入代理地址并启动\n    Claude->>Proxy: API 请求\n    Proxy->>API: 转发请求\n    API-->>Proxy: 返回响应/SSE\n    Proxy->>SSE: 如为 streaming 则重组\n    Proxy->>Usage: 归一化 token 用量\n    Proxy->>Trace: 写入 JSONL trace\n    Proxy-->>Claude: 返回响应\n    Claude-->>User: 输出交互内容\n    CLI-->>User: 退出时输出 usage summary\n```\n\n## 8. Session 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Session as Session Module\n    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant DB as Local DB\n\n    alt session-collect\n        User->>CLI: session-collect\n        CLI->>Session: 扫描 session\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 只读扫描\n        Session->>DB: 写入索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回统计\n    else session-import\n        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径\n        CLI->>Session: 导入外部数据\n        Session->>Storage: 复制到固定目录\n        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入结果\n    else session-find\n        User->>CLI: session-find 条件\n        CLI->>Session: 查询\n        Session->>DB: 读取索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    else session-push/pull/status\n        User->>CLI: session-push/pull/status\n        CLI->>Session: 执行快照功能\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 读取或写入原始 session\n        Session->>Storage: 读写本地快照\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    end\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n\n## 9. Issue 工作流时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户/Agent\n    participant Skill as Skill\n    participant Guard as Hooks Guard\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    User->>Skill: claim/fix/pr/test/review\n    Skill->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取本地镜像\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回 issue/依赖/PR\n    Issue-->>Skill: 返回状态\n    Skill->>Guard: 请求操作前检查\n    Guard->>Issue: 查询规则所需状态\n    Issue-->>Guard: 返回状态\n    alt block\n        Guard->>Log: 记录阻断\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回阻断原因\n    else allow/warn\n        Guard->>Log: 记录通过或提醒\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回决策\n        Skill->>GitHub: 用户显式动作\n        Skill->>Issue: 写入活动并触发同步\n    end\n```\n\n## 10. Sandbox 与 Tool Adapter 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Manager\n    participant Git as Git Worktree\n    participant Tool as Tool Adapter\n    participant App as 目标工具\n    participant Meta as Metadata\n\n    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool claude resume session_id\n    CLI->>Project: 识别当前项目\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回 project identity\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a sandbox\n    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree\n    alt sandbox 不存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree\n    else sandbox 已存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree\n    end\n    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 元数据\n    CLI->>Tool: 选择 claude adapter\n    Tool->>App: 在 worktree 内执行 claude resume session_id\n    Tool->>Meta: 记录工具启动\n    App-->>User: 进入目标工作环境\n```\n\n## 11. Scheduler 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Timer as 定时器/用户\n    participant Scheduler as Scheduler\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    Timer->>Scheduler: 触发任务\n    Scheduler->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取 issues/activity/dependencies\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回状态\n    Issue-->>Scheduler: 返回候选 issue\n    Scheduler->>Scheduler: 生成治理计划\n    alt dry-run\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录 preview\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出计划\n    else execute\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录计划动作\n        Scheduler->>GitHub: 执行 label/comment/assign 更新\n        GitHub-->>Scheduler: 返回结果\n        Scheduler->>Issue: 同步最新状态\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出执行报告\n    end\n```\n\n## 12. 同步时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Sync as Sync Module\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant Git as Git\n    participant Remote as 远端/外部存储\n    participant Main as 主项目目录\n\n    User->>CLI: sync/import/export/apply\n    CLI->>Sync: 请求同步动作\n    alt metadata sync\n        Sync->>Storage: 同步 metadata/session/trace\n        Sync->>Remote: 上传或下载\n    else git fetch\n        Sync->>Git: fetch 远端信息\n    else sandbox pull/push\n        Sync->>Git: 用户显式 pull/push sandbox branch\n    else apply to local\n        Sync->>Git: 生成 sandbox diff\n        Sync-->>User: 展示变更并要求确认\n        User-->>Sync: 确认\n        Sync->>Main: 应用到主项目目录\n    end\n    Sync-->>CLI: 返回同步报告\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_f3c6fa42bd5845f49699a4da"}
