[2026-05-24 18:34:19] [INFO] [PostToolBatch] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolBatch","tool_calls":[{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.0-overview.md","content":"# 3.0 模块功能设计总览\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md 的 §1-2, §4, §14-15\n\n## 1. 总体定位\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具。它围绕 Claude Code 的真实使用场景，提供 API 代理追踪、Session 索引、Issue 状态镜像、Hooks/Skill 护栏、Sandbox 工作区、Tool Adapter 和同步治理能力。\n\n核心目标：\n\n1. 记录 AI Agent API 调用和 token 用量。\n2. 固定保存 trace、session、issue、sandbox 元数据。\n3. 支持跨机器查找 session 和 trace。\n4. 支持 GitHub Issue 本地镜像和开发闭环。\n5. 支持 Git Worktree Sandbox，隔离不同分支和工具工作区。\n6. 支持 Claude、Cursor、IDEA、Trae、CMD 等工具打开同一个 sandbox。\n7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改，只有用户显式同步或 apply 才能更新。\n\n## 2. 功能清单\n\n| 功能 | 作用 | 用户价值 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 固定本地存储 | 统一 trace、session、db、log、sandbox 元数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |\n| 项目身份识别 | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 所有模块用同一项目身份关联数据 |\n| Proxy Trace | 代理 Claude API 请求并记录 JSONL trace | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |\n| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组成完整消息 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |\n| Usage 统计 | 归一化 token 用量 | 按项目、session、sandbox 统计成本 |\n| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 Claude session 和 trace | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |\n| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session 文件 | 保留现有 session-push/pull/status 能力 |\n| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue 状态 | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |\n| Hooks Guard | 在关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim、PR 前置缺失 |\n| Skill Integration | 给 issue skill 提供结构化状态查询 | claim/fix/pr/test/review 流程更可靠 |\n| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale、blocked、in-progress issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |\n| Sandbox | 用 Git Worktree 创建隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |\n| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD 到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox 改动 | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |\n| 审计日志 | 记录命令、模块动作、阻断、同步结果 | 出问题时可追踪 |\n\n## 4. 模块关系\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    CLI[CLI Router] --> Project[Project Resolver]\n    CLI --> Storage[Storage Manager]\n    CLI --> Proxy[Proxy Trace]\n    CLI --> Session[Session Module]\n    CLI --> Issue[Issue Mirror]\n    CLI --> Sandbox[Sandbox Manager]\n    CLI --> Tool[Tool Adapter]\n    CLI --> Sync[Sync Module]\n\n    Proxy --> SSE[SSE Reassembler]\n    Proxy --> Usage[Usage Normalizer]\n    Proxy --> Trace[Trace Writer]\n    Trace --> Storage\n    Session --> Storage\n    Session --> DB[(Local DB)]\n\n    Issue --> DB\n    Hooks[Hooks Guard] --> Issue\n    Skills[Skill Integration] --> Issue\n    Scheduler[Scheduler] --> Issue\n    Scheduler --> GitHub[GitHub]\n\n    Sandbox --> Git[Git Worktree]\n    Sandbox --> Storage\n    Tool --> Sandbox\n    Tool --> Apps[Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD]\n    Sync --> Storage\n    Sync --> Git\n```\n\n关系说明：\n\n1. CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。\n2. Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。\n3. Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。\n4. Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。\n5. Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。\n6. Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。\n7. Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。\n8. Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。\n\n## 14. 模块依赖顺序\n\n| 顺序 | 模块 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | CLI Router | 所有功能入口 |\n| 2 | Project Resolver | 所有数据关联基础 |\n| 3 | Storage Manager | 所有持久化基础 |\n| 4 | Proxy Trace / Trace Writer / Usage / SSE | 当前核心能力 |\n| 5 | Session Index / Snapshot | 历史上下文查询与备份 |\n| 6 | Sandbox Manager | Git worktree 工作区 |\n| 7 | Tool Adapter | 多工具启动 |\n| 8 | Issue Mirror | issue 本地状态 |\n| 9 | Hooks Guard / Skill Integration | issue 工作流护栏 |\n| 10 | Scheduler | 后台治理 |\n| 11 | Sync | 跨机器和显式同步 |\n\n## 15. 设计边界\n\nMVP 支持：\n\n1. 固定存储。\n2. Proxy trace。\n3. Usage 统计。\n4. Session 查询与快照。\n5. Sandbox worktree。\n6. Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD tool adapter。\n7. Issue Mirror 查询。\n8. Hooks/Skill 基础检查。\n\nMVP 不支持：\n\n1. 同一绝对路径不同进程看到不同内容。\n2. FUSE/WinFsp 虚拟文件系统。\n3. 自动修改主项目源代码。\n4. 自动合并、rebase、reset。\n5. 企业级权限系统。\n6. 实时多人协作编辑。\n\n## 模块文件索引\n\n| 文件 | 模块 |\n| --- | --- |\n| [3.0-overview.md](3.0-overview.md) | 总览、功能清单、模块关系、依赖顺序、设计边界 |\n| [3.1-cli-router.md](3.1-cli-router.md) | CLI Router |\n| [3.2-project-resolver.md](3.2-project-resolver.md) | Project Resolver |\n| [3.3-storage-manager.md](3.3-storage-manager.md) | Storage Manager |\n| [3.4-proxy-trace.md](3.4-proxy-trace.md) | Proxy Trace |\n| [3.5-sse-reassembler.md](3.5-sse-reassembler.md) | SSE Reassembler |\n| [3.6-usage-normalizer.md](3.6-usage-normalizer.md) | Usage Normalizer |\n| [3.7-trace-writer.md](3.7-trace-writer.md) | Trace Writer |\n| [3.8-session.md](3.8-session.md) | Session（Index + Snapshot） |\n| [3.9-issue-mirror.md](3.9-issue-mirror.md) | Issue Mirror |\n| [3.10-hooks-guard.md](3.10-hooks-guard.md) | Hooks Guard |\n| [3.11-skill-integration.md](3.11-skill-integration.md) | Skill Integration |\n| [3.12-scheduler.md](3.12-scheduler.md) | Scheduler |\n| [3.13-sandbox-manager.md](3.13-sandbox-manager.md) | Sandbox Manager |\n| [3.14-tool-adapter.md](3.14-tool-adapter.md) | Tool Adapter |\n| [3.15-sync.md](3.15-sync.md) | Sync |\n| [3.16-data-flow.md](3.16-data-flow.md) | 数据流转 |\n| [3.17-sequences.md](3.17-sequences.md) | 时序图合集 |\n| [3.18-data-objects.md](3.18-data-objects.md) | 关键数据对象 |\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_853cf6b58ab04fb795835dd5","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.0-overview.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.1-cli-router.md","content":"# 3.1 CLI Router 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.1\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 作为所有命令入口。\n2. 解析参数。\n3. 区分 proxy、session、issue、sandbox、tool、sync 等模式。\n4. 把请求分发到对应模块。\n\n## 输入\n\n```text\n用户命令、cwd、环境变量\n```\n\n## 输出\n\n```text\n模块调用请求、命令执行结果\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_4c003e09d33540d0ade61b03","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.1-cli-router.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.2-project-resolver.md","content":"# 3.2 Project Resolver 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.2\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 识别当前项目身份。\n2. 解析 git root、remote repo、branch、cwd、slug。\n3. 为 trace/session/issue/sandbox 提供统一 project identity。\n\n## 输出数据\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\"\n}\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_50a84f6008f44599ac7357f7","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.2-project-resolver.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.3-storage-manager.md","content":"# 3.3 Storage Manager 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.3\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 管理固定存储根目录。\n2. 为各模块分配 trace、session、db、logs、imports、exports 路径。\n3. 做存储健康检查。\n\n## 目录模型\n\n```text\n~/.claude-tap/\n  config/\n  db/\n  traces/\n  sessions/\n  sandboxes/\n  logs/\n  imports/\n  exports/\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_5ee7f2707e8b47cf980639ef","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.3-storage-manager.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.4-proxy-trace.md","content":"# 3.4 Proxy Trace 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.4\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 启动本地 API reverse proxy。\n2. 转发 Claude Code API 请求。\n3. 记录请求、响应、耗时、状态码。\n4. 调用 SSE Reassembler 和 Usage 模块。\n\n## 依赖\n\n```text\nProject Resolver\nStorage Manager\nSSE Reassembler\nUsage Normalizer\nTrace Writer\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_8a88691ba42646319ee9409c","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.4-proxy-trace.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.5-sse-reassembler.md","content":"# 3.5 SSE Reassembler 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.5\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 解析 SSE chunk。\n2. 将 streaming 内容重组成完整响应。\n3. 标记重组状态：complete、partial、failed。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_5c2e9cacec2f412ca9a05be5","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.5-sse-reassembler.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.6-usage-normalizer.md","content":"# 3.6 Usage Normalizer 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.6\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 统一不同 provider 的 token 字段。\n2. 输出 input、output、cache read、cache create 等统计。\n3. 支持后续按 project/session/sandbox/date 聚合。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_e592bf5aeb444148a640e4f1","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.6-usage-normalizer.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.7-trace-writer.md","content":"# 3.7 Trace Writer 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.7\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 写入 JSONL trace。\n2. 附加 project、machine、branch、sandbox、tool、session 元数据。\n3. 输出运行结束 summary。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_43e8a5b38edd4741974aa69f","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.7-trace-writer.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.8-session.md","content":"# 3.8 Session 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.8\n\n## 两类能力\n\n### Session Index\n\n作用：\n\n1. 只读扫描 Claude 原始 session。\n2. 导入外部 trace/session。\n3. 建立 session 查询索引。\n4. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session 查询。\n\n### Session Snapshot\n\n作用：\n\n1. 保留 `session-push`。\n2. 保留 `session-pull`。\n3. 保留 `session-status`。\n4. 明确 `session-pull` 会写 Claude 原始目录，必须显式触发。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_0ccf24b638834d9b8d37fd06","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.8-session.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.9-issue-mirror.md","content":"# 3.9 Issue Mirror 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.9\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 同步 GitHub Issue 到本地数据库。\n2. 提供 issue 查询、ready 列表、blocked 列表、board。\n3. 记录 issue activity。\n\n## 输出\n\n```text\nissues、dependencies、activity_log、board view\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_c3c5486ac2d940ffbf5f7c46","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.9-issue-mirror.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.10-hooks-guard.md","content":"# 3.10 Hooks Guard 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.10\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 接收 Claude Code hooks 请求。\n2. 查询 Git、Issue Mirror、Sandbox 状态。\n3. 返回 allow、warn、block。\n\n## 典型规则\n\n1. 禁止 main 分支直接编辑。\n2. claim 前检查 issue 状态。\n3. PR 前检查 rebase、Test Plan、issue 状态。\n4. destructive Git 操作前阻断或提醒。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_aed6bf47a8464a6387811392","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.10-hooks-guard.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.11-skill-integration.md","content":"# 3.11 Skill Integration 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.11\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 为 issue claim/fix/pr/test/review skill 提供本地 API。\n2. 返回结构化决策。\n3. 将 skill 执行结果写入 activity log。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_f23e890641c549d4a1e095b0","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.11-skill-integration.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.12-scheduler.md","content":"# 3.12 Scheduler 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.12\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 定时扫描 issue 状态。\n2. 生成治理计划。\n3. dry-run 输出计划。\n4. 执行 stale、release、blocked/unblocked 等动作。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_428aa77841f2446094331b64","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.12-scheduler.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.13-sandbox-manager.md","content":"# 3.13 Sandbox Manager 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.13\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 管理 Git Worktree sandbox。\n2. 查找、创建、删除、列出 sandbox。\n3. 查询 sandbox Git 状态。\n4. 提供 diff、apply、sync。\n\n## 核心规则\n\n1. `--sandbox <branch>` 指定时，如果不存在就创建。\n2. sandbox 修改只发生在 `.worktrees/<sandbox>`。\n3. 主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_1e243c2858bc43438c025ac2","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.13-sandbox-manager.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.14-tool-adapter.md","content":"# 3.14 Tool Adapter 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.14\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 根据 `--tool` 启动目标工具。\n2. 把工具启动目录切换到 sandbox worktree。\n3. 透传工具后续命令。\n\n## 支持工具\n\n| Tool | 行为 |\n| --- | --- |\n| claude | 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code，可透传 resume/new/reload |\n| cursor | 打开 worktree |\n| idea | 打开 worktree |\n| trae | 打开 worktree |\n| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD |\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_696d9c6892264f4abdf68ccd","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.14-tool-adapter.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.15-sync.md","content":"# 3.15 Sync 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.15\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 同步 metadata。\n2. 导入/导出 trace 和 session。\n3. fetch/pull/push sandbox 分支。\n4. apply sandbox 修改到主项目。\n\n## 强规则\n\n```text\nsession/metadata 可自动同步\ngit fetch 可自动执行\nsandbox pull/push/apply 必须用户显式触发\n主项目文件不能被 agent 自动修改\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_022b452218ae4f1ea42d0ed1","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.15-sync.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.16-data-flow.md","content":"# 3.16 数据流转\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §5\n\n## 5.1 Proxy Trace 数据流\n\n```text\nClaude Code API 请求\n  -> Local Proxy\n  -> Upstream API\n  -> Local Proxy\n  -> SSE Reassembler\n  -> Usage Normalizer\n  -> Trace Writer\n  -> 固定存储 traces/\n  -> Session/Usage 查询\n```\n\n## 5.2 Session 数据流\n\n**Collect（只读索引）：**\n\n```text\nClaude 原始 session\n  -> session-collect 只读扫描\n  -> Session Index\n  -> Local DB\n  -> session-find 查询\n```\n\n**Import（外部导入）：**\n\n```text\n外部 trace/session\n  -> session-import\n  -> 固定存储 imports/traces/sessions\n  -> Session Index\n  -> Local DB\n```\n\n**Snapshot（快照同步）：**\n\n```text\nClaude 原始 session\n  -> session-push\n  -> 本地快照 sessions/\n  -> session-status\n  -> session-pull\n  -> Claude 原始目录\n```\n\n## 5.3 Issue 数据流\n\n```text\nGitHub Issues\n  -> Issue Mirror sync/webhook\n  -> Local DB\n  -> /issues /board /ready\n  -> Hooks Guard / Skills / Scheduler\n  -> 用户显式动作或 scheduler 动作\n  -> GitHub\n  -> Issue Mirror 再同步\n```\n\n## 5.4 Sandbox 数据流\n\n```text\n用户命令 --sandbox branch\n  -> Project Resolver\n  -> Sandbox Manager\n  -> Git Worktree\n  -> Tool Adapter\n  -> Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae\n  -> sandbox worktree 文件变化\n  -> sandbox diff/status\n  -> 用户显式 apply/sync\n  -> 主项目或远端\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_5689cc33350f4714822dd32b","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.16-data-flow.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.17-sequences.md","content":"# 3.17 时序图合集\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §6-12\n\n## 6. 总体时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Storage as Storage Manager\n    participant Module as 目标模块\n\n    User->>CLI: 执行 claude-tap-plus 命令\n    CLI->>Project: 识别 project/cwd/git/branch/slug\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回项目身份\n    CLI->>Storage: 获取固定存储路径\n    Storage-->>CLI: 返回 db/trace/session/log 路径\n    CLI->>CLI: 解析命令模式\n    CLI->>Module: 调用目标功能\n    Module-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    CLI-->>User: 输出结果\n```\n\n## 7. Proxy Trace 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Proxy as Proxy Trace\n    participant Claude as Claude Code\n    participant API as 上游 API\n    participant SSE as SSE Reassembler\n    participant Usage as Usage Normalizer\n    participant Trace as Trace Writer\n\n    User->>CLI: claude-tap-plus claude\n    CLI->>Proxy: 启动本地代理\n    CLI->>Claude: 注入代理地址并启动\n    Claude->>Proxy: API 请求\n    Proxy->>API: 转发请求\n    API-->>Proxy: 返回响应/SSE\n    Proxy->>SSE: 如为 streaming 则重组\n    Proxy->>Usage: 归一化 token 用量\n    Proxy->>Trace: 写入 JSONL trace\n    Proxy-->>Claude: 返回响应\n    Claude-->>User: 输出交互内容\n    CLI-->>User: 退出时输出 usage summary\n```\n\n## 8. Session 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Session as Session Module\n    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant DB as Local DB\n\n    alt session-collect\n        User->>CLI: session-collect\n        CLI->>Session: 扫描 session\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 只读扫描\n        Session->>DB: 写入索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回统计\n    else session-import\n        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径\n        CLI->>Session: 导入外部数据\n        Session->>Storage: 复制到固定目录\n        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入结果\n    else session-find\n        User->>CLI: session-find 条件\n        CLI->>Session: 查询\n        Session->>DB: 读取索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    else session-push/pull/status\n        User->>CLI: session-push/pull/status\n        CLI->>Session: 执行快照功能\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 读取或写入原始 session\n        Session->>Storage: 读写本地快照\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    end\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n\n## 9. Issue 工作流时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户/Agent\n    participant Skill as Skill\n    participant Guard as Hooks Guard\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    User->>Skill: claim/fix/pr/test/review\n    Skill->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取本地镜像\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回 issue/依赖/PR\n    Issue-->>Skill: 返回状态\n    Skill->>Guard: 请求操作前检查\n    Guard->>Issue: 查询规则所需状态\n    Issue-->>Guard: 返回状态\n    alt block\n        Guard->>Log: 记录阻断\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回阻断原因\n    else allow/warn\n        Guard->>Log: 记录通过或提醒\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回决策\n        Skill->>GitHub: 用户显式动作\n        Skill->>Issue: 写入活动并触发同步\n    end\n```\n\n## 10. Sandbox 与 Tool Adapter 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Manager\n    participant Git as Git Worktree\n    participant Tool as Tool Adapter\n    participant App as 目标工具\n    participant Meta as Metadata\n\n    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool claude resume session_id\n    CLI->>Project: 识别当前项目\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回 project identity\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a sandbox\n    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree\n    alt sandbox 不存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree\n    else sandbox 已存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree\n    end\n    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 元数据\n    CLI->>Tool: 选择 claude adapter\n    Tool->>App: 在 worktree 内执行 claude resume session_id\n    Tool->>Meta: 记录工具启动\n    App-->>User: 进入目标工作环境\n```\n\n## 11. Scheduler 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Timer as 定时器/用户\n    participant Scheduler as Scheduler\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    Timer->>Scheduler: 触发任务\n    Scheduler->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取 issues/activity/dependencies\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回状态\n    Issue-->>Scheduler: 返回候选 issue\n    Scheduler->>Scheduler: 生成治理计划\n    alt dry-run\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录 preview\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出计划\n    else execute\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录计划动作\n        Scheduler->>GitHub: 执行 label/comment/assign 更新\n        GitHub-->>Scheduler: 返回结果\n        Scheduler->>Issue: 同步最新状态\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出执行报告\n    end\n```\n\n## 12. 同步时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Sync as Sync Module\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant Git as Git\n    participant Remote as 远端/外部存储\n    participant Main as 主项目目录\n\n    User->>CLI: sync/import/export/apply\n    CLI->>Sync: 请求同步动作\n    alt metadata sync\n        Sync->>Storage: 同步 metadata/session/trace\n        Sync->>Remote: 上传或下载\n    else git fetch\n        Sync->>Git: fetch 远端信息\n    else sandbox pull/push\n        Sync->>Git: 用户显式 pull/push sandbox branch\n    else apply to local\n        Sync->>Git: 生成 sandbox diff\n        Sync-->>User: 展示变更并要求确认\n        User-->>Sync: 确认\n        Sync->>Main: 应用到主项目目录\n    end\n    Sync-->>CLI: 返回同步报告\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n"},"tool_use_id":"call_f3c6fa42bd5845f49699a4da","tool_response":"File created successfully at: D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.17-sequences.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"},{"tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\3.18-data-objects.md","content":"# 3.18 关键数据对象\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §13\n\n## ProjectIdentity\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\"\n}\n```\n\n## TraceRecord\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"sandbox\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"tool\": \"claude\",\n  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"method\": \"POST\",\n  \"path\": \"/v1/messages\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"duration_ms\": 1234,\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 1000,\n    \"output_tokens\": 200\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## SessionIndex\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"trace_file_path\": \"traces/WIN-DEV/c