e, project, session_id, file directory.\n\n8. **I simplified the modules**:\n   - Renamed 02-session-sync → 02-session-index (collect + find only)\n   - Deleted 04-session-registry (no heartbeat/orphaned/bind)\n   - Renumbered remaining modules\n   - Updated 00-overview.md with simplified scope\n\n9. **User asked about working mechanism** - I explained two runtime modes (CLI vs serve), SQLite as collaboration hub, and data flow between modules.\n\n10. **User clarified session recording**: \"这里先不做对应的一个session恢复机制，只做对应的一个记录的\" - confirmed pure read-only indexing.\n\n11. **User asked about \"原始的消息的一个记录\"** - They want claude-tap-plus to also record its own copy of API messages through the proxy, not just index Claude Code's files.\n\n12. **I updated 02-session-index.md** to include both: ① proxy message recording (trace) and ② session indexing. Two file paths per record: claude_file_path (Claude Code's, read-only) and trace_file_path (claude-tap-plus's own).\n\n13. **User asked for hierarchical storage and import**: \"traces需要支持不同机器上，不同文件夹里面的项目一个聊天数据的一个导入的\" + \"分机器，分项目，项目有分不同的一个系统以及对应的文件夹的\"\n\n14. **I updated 02-session-index.md** with:\n    - Hierarchical trace storage: `traces/{machine}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/`\n    - New `session-import` command\n    - Added `os` and `source` fields to SQLite\n    - Updated SQLite schema\n\n15. **User's modules directory files were modified externally** - Several files (05-scheduler.md, 07-sandbox.md, 06-skill-integration.md, 04-hooks-guard.md, 00-overview.md, 01-fixed-storage.md, 03-issue-mirror.md, 02-session-index.md) were updated with additional \"功能需求补全\" sections and sequence diagrams. The overview got significantly expanded with current implementation module split and priority tables.\n\n16. **User asked to split 09-module-functional-design.md into 3.x files** - I created 19 files (3.0 through 3.18) covering all modules, data flows, sequences, and data objects.\n\n17. **User asked to design CLI Router** (3.1-cli-router.md) -