 tools, recording API traffic as JSONL traces\n   - **Git Worktree**: Sandbox isolation mechanism (MVP approach)\n   - **SQLite**: Shared state store between modules (session index, issue mirror, activity log)\n   - **Two runtime modes**: CLI single commands (session-collect, session-find, sandbox) vs serve mode (long-running HTTP service for Issue Mirror + Scheduler)\n   - **Claude Code session storage**: `~/.claude/projects/{slug}/` where slug is derived from cwd absolute path\n   - **Kimi CLI**: Moonshot AI's terminal AI agent (`kimi` binary, `KIMI_BASE_URL` env var, `api.moonshot.ai/v1` upstream)\n   - **ClientConfig struct**: Abstracted provider config supporting multiple AI CLI tools (Cmd, BaseURLEnv, DefaultTarget, NestingEnvKeys, InjectSettingsEnv)\n   - **Trace hierarchical storage**: `~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`\n   - **Session vs Agent distinction**: Agent = persistent identity (machine+user), Session = one tool invocation\n   - **Issue Mirror**: Local SQLite cache of GitHub Issues for fast querying without hitting GitHub API\n   - **Provider difference**: Claude Code uses env var + `--settings` for proxy injection; Kimi CLI uses env var only\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **Source document**: `doc/otherDoc/2026-05-23/claude-tap-plus-unified-requirements.md`\n     - 1772-line unified requirements document covering all modules (§1-§15)\n     - Read in full to understand module boundaries\n\n   - **Module files created in `claude-tap-plus-modules/`** (first level):\n     - `00-overview.md` - Shared context, goals, non-goals, tech choices, phases, risks, success metrics, module index. Was externally updated with expanded content including current implementation module split, priority tables, and proxy trace sequence diagrams.\n     - `01-fixed-storage.md` - Fixed local storage for trace/session data. Was externally updated with 功能需求补全.\n     - `02-session-index.md` - Session indexing + trace recording. Key SQLite schema:\n       ```sql\n       CREATE TABLE session_index (\n           session_id       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n           machine_id       TEXT NOT NULL,\n           project          TEXT NOT NULL,\n           os               TEXT NOT NULL,\n           slug             TEXT NOT NULL,\n           cwd              TEXT NOT NULL,\n           claude_file_path TEXT,\n           trace_file_path  TEXT NOT NULL,\n           trace_file_size  INTEGER,\n           trace_record_count INTEGER,\n           source           TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'local',\n           branch           TEXT,\n           first_ts         TEXT,\n           last_ts         TEXT,\n           collected_at     TEXT NOT NULL\n       );\n       ```\n       Three commands: `session-collect`, `session-find`, `session-import`\n       Hierarchical storage: `traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl`\n       Was externally updated with 功能需求补全.\n     - `03-issue-mirror.md` - GitHub Issue local mirror. Was externally updated with 功能需求补全.\n     - `04-hooks-guard.md` - Claude Code hooks guard rules (P0 block, P1 warn). Was externally updated with 功能需求补全 and sequence diagram.\n     - `05-scheduler.md` - Periodic issue governance (stale, release, blocked). Was externally updated with 功能需求补全 and sequence diagram.\n     - `06-skill-integration.md` - Issue skill API integration. Was externally updated with 功能需求补全 and sequence diagram.\n     - `07-sandbox.md` - Git Worktree sandbox management + Tool Adapter. Was externally updated with 功能需求补全 and sequence diagrams.\n\n   - **Module functional design files in `modules/` subdirectory** (3.x series from 09-module-functional-design.md):\n     - `modules/3.0-overview.md` - Module overview, relationships, dependency order, design boundaries\n     - `modules/3.1-cli-router.md` - **CLI Router design** (most recent work, detailed below)\n     - `modules/3.2-project-resolver.md` - Project identity resolution\n     - `modules/3.3-storage-manager.md` - Fixed storage management\n     - `modules/3.4-proxy-trace.md` - API reverse proxy\n     - `modules/3.5-sse-reassembler.md` - SSE stream reassembly\n     - `modules/3.6-usage-normalizer.md` - Token usage normalization\n     - `modules/3.7-trace-writer.md` - JSONL trace writing\n     - `modules/3.8-session.md` - Session Index + Snapshot\n     - `modules/3.9-issue-mirror.md` - Issue mirror\n     - `modules/3.10-hooks-guard.md` - Hooks guard\n     - `modules/3.11-skill-integration.md` - Skill integration\n     - `modules/3.12-scheduler.md` - Scheduler\n     - `modules/3.13-sandbox-manager.md` - Sandbox manager\n     - `modules/3.14-tool-adapter.md` - Tool adapter\n     - `modules/3.15-sync.md` - Sync module\n     - `modules/3.16-data-flow.md` - Data flow diagrams (4 flows)\n     - `modules/3.17-sequences.md` - Sequence diagrams (7 diagrams)\n     - `modules/3.18-data-objects.md` - Key data objects (ProjectIdentity, TraceRecord, SessionIndex, SandboxRecord, IssueRecord)\n\n   - **Existing code files read**:\n     - `claude_tap_plus/cmd/claude-tap/main.go` - Current CLI entry point with switch-based subcommand routing (session-push/pull/status), default proxy mode\n     - `claude_tap_plus/internal/config/client.go` - ClientConfig struct and ClaudeClient definition:\n       ```go\n       type ClientConfig struct {\n           Cmd               string\n           BaseURLEnv         string\n           DefaultTarget      string\n           NestingEnvKeys     []string\n           InjectSettingsEnv  bool\n       }\n       var ClaudeClient = ClientConfig{\n           Cmd:              \"claude\",\n           BaseURLEnv:       \"ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL\",\n           DefaultTarget:    \"https://api.anthropic.com\",\n           NestingEnvKeys:   []string{\"CLAUDECODE\", \"CLAUDE_CODE_SSE_PORT\"},\n           InjectSettingsEnv: true,\n       }\n       ```\n\n   - **Deleted files** (old module numbers that were superseded):\n     - 02-session-sync.md, 04-session-registry.md, 05-hooks-guard.md (old), 06-scheduler.md (old), 07-skill-integration.md (old), 08-sandbox.md (old)\n\n   - **3.1-cli-router.md** (the most recent file, written to both locations):\n     MVP command set: `claude`, `kimi`, `session-collect`, `session-find`, `session-import`, `session-push`, `session-pull`, `session-status`\n     Two provider configs designed:\n     ```go\n     KimiClient = ClientConfig{\n         Cmd:              \"kimi\",\n         BaseURLEnv:       \"KIMI_BASE_URL\",\n         DefaultTarget:    \"https://api.moonshot.ai/v1\",\n         NestingEnvKeys:   []string{},\n         InjectSettingsEnv: false,\n     }\n     ```\n     Route dispatch logic: first arg matches subcommand, falls through to auto-detect proxy mode for backward compatibility.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No code errors encountered. This was entirely a documentation/design task.\n   - User corrections drove simplification:\n     - User said don't do session restore → removed session-pull/heartbeat/orphaned from scope\n     - User said only record, don't change Claude Code storage → reinforced read-only principle\n     - User said traces need hierarchical storage by machine/project/OS → redesigned storage structure\n     - User said need external trace import → added session-import command\n     - User said write to modules/ directory → copied file to correct location\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Identified that Agent ≠ Session (persistent identity vs single invocation)\n   - Clarified Issue Mirror is local SQLite cache, not a replacement for GitHub Issues\n   - Identified that Kimi CLI uses only env var injection (no --settings like Claude Code)\n   - Designed minimal SQLite schema for session indexing that answers: which machine, which project, where is the file\n   - Resolved backward compatibility for existing `claude-tap-plus` (no args) → default to Claude Code proxy\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"我需要你根据...抽离出不同的一个模块，只需要模块抽离就可以了\"\n   - \"这里面的核心是什么呢？？？以及不同接口的一个协同\"\n   - \"同一个session是一个agent么