[2026-05-24 18:59:36] [INFO] [PreToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\16c0b654-a721-4e3e-83a2-4b840a8162b9.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Edit","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\modules\\3.1-cli-router.md","old_string":"## 路由分发逻辑\n\n```text\nclaude-tap-plus [args]\n  │\n  ├── args[0] == \"claude\"           → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"kimi\"             → runProxy(KimiClient, args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-collect\"  → runSessionCollect(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-find\"     → runSessionFind(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-import\"   → runSessionImport(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-push\"     → runSessionPush(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-pull\"     → runSessionPull(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-status\"   → runSessionStatus(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"help\" / --help    → printUsage()\n  │\n  └── 其他                          → 自动检测并启动代理（兼容旧用法）\n        ├── 检测到 --claude         → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args)\n        ├── 检测到 --kimi           → runProxy(KimiClient, args)\n        └── 默认                    → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args)\n```","new_string":"## 路由分发逻辑\n\n```text\nclaude-tap-plus [args]\n  │\n  │ ── Proxy 模块 (3.4) ──\n  ├── args[0] == \"claude\"           → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"kimi\"             → runProxy(KimiClient, args[1:])\n  │\n  │ ── Session 模块 (3.8) ──\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-collect\"  → runSessionCollect(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-find\"     → runSessionFind(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-import\"   → runSessionImport(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-push\"     → runSessionPush(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-pull\"     → runSessionPull(args[1:])\n  ├── args[0] == \"session-status\"   → runSessionStatus(args[1:])\n  │\n  │ ── 通用 ──\n  ├── args[0] == \"help\" / --help    → printUsage()\n  ├── args[0] == \"version\" / --version → printVersion()\n  │\n  │ ── 后续模块占位 ──\n  ├── args[0] == \"serve\"            → runServe(args[1:])           // Issue Mirror (3.9)\n  ├── args[0] == \"sandbox\"          → runSandbox(args[1:])         // Sandbox (3.13)\n  ├── args[0] == \"sync\"             → runSync(args[1:])            // Sync (3.15)\n  │\n  └── 其他                          → 自动检测并启动代理（兼容旧用法）  // Proxy (3.4)\n        ├── 检测到 --claude         → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args)\n        ├── 检测到 --kimi           → runProxy(KimiClient, args)\n        └── 默认                    → runProxy(ClaudeClient, args)\n```\n\n### 分发规则\n\n1. `args[0]` 匹配已知子命令 → 路由到对应模块处理函数。\n2. `args[0]` 不匹配任何子命令 → 走默认代理模式（向后兼容当前行为）。\n3. 后续模块（serve/sandbox/sync）预留路由，MVP 阶段输出 \"not yet implemented\"。\n4. 每个处理函数只消费自己的参数，剩余部分按规则透传或报错。","replace_all":false},"tool_use_id":"call_9284c8eabda64a378568b9cb"}
