[2026-05-24 21:28:48] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\02-session-index.md","content":"# 模块 2：Session 索引与消息记录\n\n> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：无（可独立运行）\n\n## 目标\n\n为 Claude Code session 建立本地只读索引，支持按机器、项目、分支快速查找。代理模式下同时记录一份完整的 API 消息。支持从其他机器导入 traces。\n\n**核心原则：不动 Claude Code 的原始存储。**\n\n## 功能\n\n### 功能 1：Session 只读索引\n\n只读扫描 Claude Code 原始 session，不主动修改 `~/.claude/`。\n\n1. 扫描本机 Claude session 文件。\n2. 解析 session_id、时间、cwd、slug、project、branch。\n3. 写入本地索引库。\n4. 重复扫描必须幂等。\n5. 无法解析的文件进入 skipped 列表并记录原因。\n\n### 功能 2：Trace 与 Session 关联\n\n代理产生的 trace 需要能和 session 建立关联。\n\n1. trace 中存在 session_id 时直接关联。\n2. trace 中没有 session_id 时，使用 cwd、时间窗口、project 做弱关联。\n3. 查询时要区分强关联和弱关联。\n4. 关联失败不影响 trace 保存。\n\n### 功能 3：外部导入\n\n支持从其他机器导入 trace/session 数据。\n\n1. 支持完整目录导入。\n2. 支持单个 JSONL 文件导入。\n3. 支持指定来源的机器、项目、系统、slug。\n4. 同 session_id 默认跳过，强制模式才覆盖。\n5. 导入数据必须标记来源为 import。\n\n### 功能 4：Session 查询\n\n提供多维查询：\n\n1. 支持按 machine、project、os、slug、branch、session、source 查询。\n2. 支持表格输出和 JSON 输出。\n3. 查询结果必须显示原始路径、trace 路径、来源机器。\n4. 不存在结果时给出可用筛选建议。\n"},"tool_response":{"type":"update","filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\02-session-index.md","content":"# 模块 2：Session 索引与消息记录\n\n> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：无（可独立运行）\n\n## 目标\n\n为 Claude Code session 建立本地只读索引，支持按机器、项目、分支快速查找。代理模式下同时记录一份完整的 API 消息。支持从其他机器导入 traces。\n\n**核心原则：不动 Claude Code 的原始存储。**\n\n## 功能\n\n### 功能 1：Session 只读索引\n\n只读扫描 Claude Code 原始 session，不主动修改 `~/.claude/`。\n\n1. 扫描本机 Claude session 文件。\n2. 解析 session_id、时间、cwd、slug、project、branch。\n3. 写入本地索引库。\n4. 重复扫描必须幂等。\n5. 无法解析的文件进入 skipped 列表并记录原因。\n\n### 功能 2：Trace 与 Session 关联\n\n代理产生的 trace 需要能和 session 建立关联。\n\n1. trace 中存在 session_id 时直接关联。\n2. trace 中没有 session_id 时，使用 cwd、时间窗口、project 做弱关联。\n3. 查询时要区分强关联和弱关联。\n4. 关联失败不影响 trace 保存。\n\n### 功能 3：外部导入\n\n支持从其他机器导入 trace/session 数据。\n\n1. 支持完整目录导入。\n2. 支持单个 JSONL 文件导入。\n3. 支持指定来源的机器、项目、系统、slug。\n4. 同 session_id 默认跳过，强制模式才覆盖。\n5. 导入数据必须标记来源为 import。\n\n### 功能 4：Session 查询\n\n提供多维查询：\n\n1. 支持按 machine、project、os、slug、branch、session、source 查询。\n2. 支持表格输出和 JSON 输出。\n3. 查询结果必须显示原始路径、trace 路径、来源机器。\n4. 不存在结果时给出可用筛选建议。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":268,"newStart":1,"newLines":19,"lines":[" # 模块 2：Session 索引与消息记录"," "," > 阶段：M2 | 依赖：无（可独立运行）","-> 2026-05-24 更新：traces 按机器/项目/系统/目录分层存储，支持外部导入。"," ","-## 核心原则","+## 目标"," ","-**不动 Claude Code 的原始存储。**","+为 Claude Code session 建立本地只读索引，支持按机器、项目、分支快速查找。代理模式下同时记录一份完整的 API 消息。支持从其他机器导入 traces。"," ","-`claude-tap-plus` 做三件事：","-1. 代理模式下自己记一份完整的 API 消息","-2. 按机器 → 项目 → 系统 → 目录 分层组织存储","-3. 支持从其他机器导入 traces","+**核心原则：不动 Claude Code 的原始存储。**"," ","-## Trace 存储目录结构","+## 功能"," ","-```text","-~/.claude-tap/","-  ├── db/","-  │     └── claude-tap.db","-  │","-  └── traces/","-        ├── machine-A/                          ← 按机器","-        │     ├── claude-hk/                    ← 按项目","-        │     │     ├── windows/                ← 按操作系统","-        │     │     │     ├── D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk/   ← 按 slug/目录","-        │     │     │     │     ├── abc123.jsonl","-        │     │     │     │     └── def456.jsonl","-        │     │     │     └── D--Code-another-project/","-        │     │     │           └── xyz789.jsonl","-        │     │     └── (其他机器同项目的 traces 不会放这里)","-        │     └── another-project/","-        │           └── windows/","-        │                 └── .../","-        │","-        └── machine-B/","-              ├── claude-hk/","-              │     ├── linux/","-              │     │     └── -home-user-code-claude-hk/","-              │     │           └── ghi789.jsonl","-              │     └── macos/","-              │           └── -Users-x-code-claude-hk/","-              │                 └── jkl012.jsonl","-              └── ...","-```","-","-**分层规则：机器 → 项目 → 操作系统 → slug（目录）**","-","-| 层级 | 含义 | 来源 |","-|------|------|------|","-| `machine-A` | 哪台电脑 | hostname 或配置的 machine_id |","-| `claude-hk` | 哪个项目 | git remote repo name |","-| `windows` | 什么系统 | `runtime.GOOS` |","-| `D--Code-...` | 项目在该机器上的 slug | Claude Code 的 slug 编码 |","-","-这样你拿到一个 trace 文件，光看路径就知道：","-> 这是 machine-A 上、claude-hk 项目、Windows 系统、D:\\Code\\claude-hk 目录下的 session。","-","-## SQLite 表结构","-","-```sql","-CREATE TABLE session_index (","-    session_id       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,","-    machine_id       TEXT NOT NULL,","-    project          TEXT NOT NULL,","-    os               TEXT NOT NULL,","-    slug             TEXT NOT NULL,","-    cwd              TEXT NOT NULL,","-","-    -- Claude Code 原始 session 文件（只读引用，本机才有）","-    claude_file_path TEXT,","-","-    -- claude-tap-plus 的 trace 文件","-    trace_file_path  TEXT NOT NULL,","-    trace_file_size  INTEGER,","-    trace_record_count INTEGER,","-","-    -- 来源","-    source           TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'local',","-    -- 'local'   = 本机代理产生的","-    -- 'import'  = 从外部导入的","-","-    -- 附带信息","-    branch           TEXT,","-    first_ts         TEXT,","-    last_ts         TEXT,","-    collected_at     TEXT NOT NULL","-);","-","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_machine  ON session_index(machine_id);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_project  ON session_index(project);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_os       ON session_index(machine_id, os);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_branch   ON session_index(branch);","-CREATE INDEX idx_session_slug     ON session_index(machine_id, slug);","-```","-","-| 字段 | 说明 |","-|------|------|","-| `machine_id` | 哪台机器 |","-| `project` | 哪个项目 |","-| `os` | 什么系统（windows / linux / darwin） |","-| `slug` | 项目在该机器上的 slug |","-| `cwd` | 项目在该机器上的实际路径 |","-| `claude_file_path` | Claude Code 的 session 文件（本机有，导入的没有） |","-| `trace_file_path` | claude-tap-plus 的 trace 文件 |","-| `source` | local（本机产生） / import（外部导入） |","-","-## 三条命令","-","-### 1. session-collect：扫描本机建索引","-","-```bash","-# 扫描本机所有 session 和 trace","-claude-tap-plus session-collect","-","-# 只看不写","-claude-tap-plus session-collect --dry-run","-```","-","-流程：","-","-```text","-session-collect","-  │","-  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname）、os（runtime.GOOS）","-  │","-  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/{slug}/","-  │     → 记录 claude_file_path","-  │","-  ├── 3. 扫描 ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/","-  │     → 记录 trace_file_path","-  │","-  ├── 4. UPSERT 到 SQLite","-  └── 5. 输出统计","-```","-","-### 2. session-import：从外部导入 traces","-","-把其他机器的 trace 文件导入到自己的存储结构中：","-","-```bash","-# 从 U 盘 / 网络共享 / 任意目录导入","-claude-tap-plus session-import /path/to/external/traces/","-","-# 从另一个 claude-tap 的完整目录导入","-claude-tap-plus session-import /mnt/usb/claude-tap-backup/","-","-# 只看不写","-claude-tap-plus session-import /path/to/external/ --dry-run","-```","-","-导入流程：","-","-```text","-session-import /mnt/usb/traces/","-  │","-  ├── 1. 扫描源目录，识别结构：","-  │     情况 A：已经是分层结构（machine/project/os/slug/*.jsonl）","-  │     情况 B：平铺结构（直接一堆 .jsonl）","-  │     情况 C：单个项目目录","-  │","-  ├── 2. 对每个 .jsonl 文件：","-  │     ├── 读取内容提取 session_id、project、machine_id 等信息","-  │     ├── 如果文件头包含元数据 → 直接用","-  │     ├── 如果没有 → 从目录结构推断，或要求用户指定","-  │     │","-  │     ├── 目标路径：","-  │     │   ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl","-  │     │","-  │     ├── 复制文件到目标路径","-  │     └── 写入 SQLite（source = 'import'）","-  │","-  └── 3. 输出：导入 N 个文件，跳过 M 个（已存在）","-```","-","-**导入时的冲突处理：**","-","-| 场景 | 处理 |","-|------|------|","-| 同 session_id 已存在 | 跳过（除非 `--force`） |","-| 源文件缺少 machine_id | 用 `--machine` 参数指定，或从目录名推断 |","-| 源文件缺少 project | 用 `--project` 参数指定，或从 .jsonl 内容推断 |","-| 源文件缺少 os | 用 `--os` 参数指定，或默认 `unknown` |","-","-### 3. session-find：查询","-","-```bash","-# 按项目查","-claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk","-","-# 按机器查","-claude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A","-","-# 按机器 + 系统","-claude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A --os linux","-","-# 按机器 + 项目 + slug","-claude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A --project claude-hk --slug D--Code-...","-","-# 按 session_id","-claude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123","-","-# 只看导入的","-claude-tap-plus session-find --source import","-```","-","-输出：","-","-```text","-SESSION_ID   MACHINE     OS       PROJECT     SLUG              CWD                           SOURCE   TRACE_FILE","-abc123       WIN-DEV     windows  claude-hk   D--Code-...       D:\\Code\\claude-hk             local    traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/D--Code-.../abc123.jsonl","-def456       WIN-DEV     windows  claude-hk   D--Code-...       D:\\Code\\claude-hk             local    traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/D--Code-.../def456.jsonl","-ghi789       MAC-PRO     darwin   claude-hk   -Users-x-...      /Users/x/code/claude-hk      import   traces/MAC-PRO/claude-hk/darwin/-Users-x-.../ghi789.jsonl","-jkl012       UBUNTU-01   linux    claude-hk   -home-u-...       /home/user/code/claude-hk    import   traces/UBUNTU-01/claude-hk/linux/-home-u-.../jkl012.jsonl","-```","-","-## 代理模式写入 trace","-","-代理运行时，trace 文件直接写到分层目录：","-","-```text","-用户执行: claude-tap-plus claude","-  │","-  ├── 确定 machine_id = hostname","-  ├── 确定 project = git remote repo name","-  ├── 确定 os = runtime.GOOS","-  ├── 确定 slug = 从 cwd 计算","-  │","-  ├── 写 trace 到:","-  │   ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl","-  │","-  └── 写索引到 SQLite","-```","-","-## 数据视图","-","-站在查询角度，你可以按任意维度切：","-","-```text","-所有项目:       session-find","-某台机器:       session-find --machine WIN-DEV","-某台机器某项目: session-find --machine WIN-DEV --project claude-hk","-某项目某系统:   session-find --project claude-hk --os windows","-某台机器某目录: session-find --machine WIN-DEV --slug D--Code-...","-只看导入的:     session-find --source import","-只看本机的:     session-find --source local","-```","-","-## 验收标准","-","-1. 代理模式 trace 写入 `traces/{machine}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/` 分层目录。","-2. `session-import` 能从外部目录导入 traces 并正确放到分层结构中。","-3. 导入的 trace 标记 `source = 'import'`，本机产生的标记 `source = 'local'`。","-4. `session-find` 按任意维度组合查询正常。","-5. 同一 session_id 不会重复导入（幂等）。","-6. Claude Code 的 `~/.claude/` 目录内容未被修改。","-","-## 功能需求补全","-"," ### 功能 1：Session 只读索引"," ","-Session 索引模块默认只读扫描 Claude Code 原始 session，不主动修改 `~/.claude/`。","+只读扫描 Claude Code 原始 session，不主动修改 `~/.claude/`。"," ","-功能要求：","-"," 1. 扫描本机 Claude session 文件。"," 2. 解析 session_id、时间、cwd、slug、project、branch。"," 3. 写入本地索引库。"]},{"oldStart":273,"oldLines":8,"newStart":24,"newLines":6,"lines":[" "," 代理产生的 trace 需要能和 session 建立关联。"," ","-功能要求：","-"," 1. trace 中存在 session_id 时直接关联。"," 2. trace 中没有 session_id 时，使用 cwd、时间窗口、project 做弱关联。"," 3. 查询时要区分强关联和弱关联。"]},{"oldStart":284,"oldLines":79,"newStart":33,"newLines":17,"lines":[" "," 支持从其他机器导入 trace/session 数据。"," ","-功能要求：","-"," 1. 支持完整目录导入。"," 2. 支持单个 JSONL 文件导入。","-3. 支持指定 `--machine`、`--project`、`--os`、`--slug`。","-4. 同 session_id 默认跳过，`--force` 才覆盖。","-5. 导入数据必须标记 `source=import`。","+3. 支持指定来源的机器、项目、系统、slug。","+4. 同 session_id 默认跳过，强制模式才覆盖。","+5. 导入数据必须标记来源为 import。"," "," ### 功能 4：Session 查询"," "," 提供多维查询："," ","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk","-claude-tap-plus session-find --machine WIN-DEV","-claude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123","-claude-tap-plus session-find --branch feature-a","-claude-tap-plus session-find --source import","-```","-","-功能要求：","-","-1. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session/source 查询。","+1. 支持按 machine、project、os、slug、branch、session、source 查询。"," 2. 支持表格输出和 JSON 输出。"," 3. 查询结果必须显示原始路径、trace 路径、来源机器。"," 4. 不存在结果时给出可用筛选建议。","-","-## 功能时序图","-","-### session-collect","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus","-    participant Session as Session 索引","-    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录","-    participant Trace as Trace 存储","-    participant DB as 索引库","-","-    User->>CLI: session-collect","-    CLI->>Session: 启动只读扫描","-    Session->>ClaudeDir: 扫描 session JSONL","-    Session->>Trace: 扫描本地 trace","-    Session->>Session: 解析并关联 session/trace","-    Session->>DB: upsert 索引记录","-    DB-->>Session: 返回写入统计","-    Session-->>CLI: 返回 collected/skipped","-    CLI-->>User: 输出扫描结果","-```","-","-### session-import/find","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus","-    participant Session as Session 索引","-    participant Storage as 固定存储","-    participant DB as 索引库","-","-    alt 导入","-        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径","-        CLI->>Session: 请求导入","-        Session->>Storage: 复制到标准目录","-        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import","-        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入统计","-    else 查询","-        User->>CLI: session-find 条件","-        CLI->>Session: 请求查询","-        Session->>DB: 查询索引","-        DB-->>Session: 返回结果","-        Session-->>CLI: 格式化输出","-    end","-    CLI-->>User: 展示结果","-```"]}],"originalFile":"# 模块 2：Session 索引与消息记录\n\n> 阶段：M2 | 依赖：无（可独立运行）\n> 2026-05-24 更新：traces 按机器/项目/系统/目录分层存储，支持外部导入。\n\n## 核心原则\n\n**不动 Claude Code 的原始存储。**\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 做三件事：\n1. 代理模式下自己记一份完整的 API 消息\n2. 按机器 → 项目 → 系统 → 目录 分层组织存储\n3. 支持从其他机器导入 traces\n\n## Trace 存储目录结构\n\n```text\n~/.claude-tap/\n  ├── db/\n  │     └── claude-tap.db\n  │\n  └── traces/\n        ├── machine-A/                          ← 按机器\n        │     ├── claude-hk/                    ← 按项目\n        │     │     ├── windows/                ← 按操作系统\n        │     │     │     ├── D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk/   ← 按 slug/目录\n        │     │     │     │     ├── abc123.jsonl\n        │     │     │     │     └── def456.jsonl\n        │     │     │     └── D--Code-another-project/\n        │     │     │           └── xyz789.jsonl\n        │     │     └── (其他机器同项目的 traces 不会放这里)\n        │     └── another-project/\n        │           └── windows/\n        │                 └── .../\n        │\n        └── machine-B/\n              ├── claude-hk/\n              │     ├── linux/\n              │     │     └── -home-user-code-claude-hk/\n              │     │           └── ghi789.jsonl\n              │     └── macos/\n              │           └── -Users-x-code-claude-hk/\n              │                 └── jkl012.jsonl\n              └── ...\n```\n\n**分层规则：机器 → 项目 → 操作系统 → slug（目录）**\n\n| 层级 | 含义 | 来源 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `machine-A` | 哪台电脑 | hostname 或配置的 machine_id |\n| `claude-hk` | 哪个项目 | git remote repo name |\n| `windows` | 什么系统 | `runtime.GOOS` |\n| `D--Code-...` | 项目在该机器上的 slug | Claude Code 的 slug 编码 |\n\n这样你拿到一个 trace 文件，光看路径就知道：\n> 这是 machine-A 上、claude-hk 项目、Windows 系统、D:\\Code\\claude-hk 目录下的 session。\n\n## SQLite 表结构\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE session_index (\n    session_id       TEXT PRIMARY KEY,\n    machine_id       TEXT NOT NULL,\n    project          TEXT NOT NULL,\n    os               TEXT NOT NULL,\n    slug             TEXT NOT NULL,\n    cwd              TEXT NOT NULL,\n\n    -- Claude Code 原始 session 文件（只读引用，本机才有）\n    claude_file_path TEXT,\n\n    -- claude-tap-plus 的 trace 文件\n    trace_file_path  TEXT NOT NULL,\n    trace_file_size  INTEGER,\n    trace_record_count INTEGER,\n\n    -- 来源\n    source           TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'local',\n    -- 'local'   = 本机代理产生的\n    -- 'import'  = 从外部导入的\n\n    -- 附带信息\n    branch           TEXT,\n    first_ts         TEXT,\n    last_ts         TEXT,\n    collected_at     TEXT NOT NULL\n);\n\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_machine  ON session_index(machine_id);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_project  ON session_index(project);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_os       ON session_index(machine_id, os);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_branch   ON session_index(branch);\nCREATE INDEX idx_session_slug     ON session_index(machine_id, slug);\n```\n\n| 字段 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `machine_id` | 哪台机器 |\n| `project` | 哪个项目 |\n| `os` | 什么系统（windows / linux / darwin） |\n| `slug` | 项目在该机器上的 slug |\n| `cwd` | 项目在该机器上的实际路径 |\n| `claude_file_path` | Claude Code 的 session 文件（本机有，导入的没有） |\n| `trace_file_path` | claude-tap-plus 的 trace 文件 |\n| `source` | local（本机产生） / import（外部导入） |\n\n## 三条命令\n\n### 1. session-collect：扫描本机建索引\n\n```bash\n# 扫描本机所有 session 和 trace\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect\n\n# 只看不写\nclaude-tap-plus session-collect --dry-run\n```\n\n流程：\n\n```text\nsession-collect\n  │\n  ├── 1. 确定 machine_id（hostname）、os（runtime.GOOS）\n  │\n  ├── 2. 扫描 ~/.claude/projects/{slug}/\n  │     → 记录 claude_file_path\n  │\n  ├── 3. 扫描 ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/\n  │     → 记录 trace_file_path\n  │\n  ├── 4. UPSERT 到 SQLite\n  └── 5. 输出统计\n```\n\n### 2. session-import：从外部导入 traces\n\n把其他机器的 trace 文件导入到自己的存储结构中：\n\n```bash\n# 从 U 盘 / 网络共享 / 任意目录导入\nclaude-tap-plus session-import /path/to/external/traces/\n\n# 从另一个 claude-tap 的完整目录导入\nclaude-tap-plus session-import /mnt/usb/claude-tap-backup/\n\n# 只看不写\nclaude-tap-plus session-import /path/to/external/ --dry-run\n```\n\n导入流程：\n\n```text\nsession-import /mnt/usb/traces/\n  │\n  ├── 1. 扫描源目录，识别结构：\n  │     情况 A：已经是分层结构（machine/project/os/slug/*.jsonl）\n  │     情况 B：平铺结构（直接一堆 .jsonl）\n  │     情况 C：单个项目目录\n  │\n  ├── 2. 对每个 .jsonl 文件：\n  │     ├── 读取内容提取 session_id、project、machine_id 等信息\n  │     ├── 如果文件头包含元数据 → 直接用\n  │     ├── 如果没有 → 从目录结构推断，或要求用户指定\n  │     │\n  │     ├── 目标路径：\n  │     │   ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl\n  │     │\n  │     ├── 复制文件到目标路径\n  │     └── 写入 SQLite（source = 'import'）\n  │\n  └── 3. 输出：导入 N 个文件，跳过 M 个（已存在）\n```\n\n**导入时的冲突处理：**\n\n| 场景 | 处理 |\n|------|------|\n| 同 session_id 已存在 | 跳过（除非 `--force`） |\n| 源文件缺少 machine_id | 用 `--machine` 参数指定，或从目录名推断 |\n| 源文件缺少 project | 用 `--project` 参数指定，或从 .jsonl 内容推断 |\n| 源文件缺少 os | 用 `--os` 参数指定，或默认 `unknown` |\n\n### 3. session-find：查询\n\n```bash\n# 按项目查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk\n\n# 按机器查\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A\n\n# 按机器 + 系统\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A --os linux\n\n# 按机器 + 项目 + slug\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine machine-A --project claude-hk --slug D--Code-...\n\n# 按 session_id\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123\n\n# 只看导入的\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --source import\n```\n\n输出：\n\n```text\nSESSION_ID   MACHINE     OS       PROJECT     SLUG              CWD                           SOURCE   TRACE_FILE\nabc123       WIN-DEV     windows  claude-hk   D--Code-...       D:\\Code\\claude-hk             local    traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/D--Code-.../abc123.jsonl\ndef456       WIN-DEV     windows  claude-hk   D--Code-...       D:\\Code\\claude-hk             local    traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/D--Code-.../def456.jsonl\nghi789       MAC-PRO     darwin   claude-hk   -Users-x-...      /Users/x/code/claude-hk      import   traces/MAC-PRO/claude-hk/darwin/-Users-x-.../ghi789.jsonl\njkl012       UBUNTU-01   linux    claude-hk   -home-u-...       /home/user/code/claude-hk    import   traces/UBUNTU-01/claude-hk/linux/-home-u-.../jkl012.jsonl\n```\n\n## 代理模式写入 trace\n\n代理运行时，trace 文件直接写到分层目录：\n\n```text\n用户执行: claude-tap-plus claude\n  │\n  ├── 确定 machine_id = hostname\n  ├── 确定 project = git remote repo name\n  ├── 确定 os = runtime.GOOS\n  ├── 确定 slug = 从 cwd 计算\n  │\n  ├── 写 trace 到:\n  │   ~/.claude-tap/traces/{machine_id}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/{session_id}.jsonl\n  │\n  └── 写索引到 SQLite\n```\n\n## 数据视图\n\n站在查询角度，你可以按任意维度切：\n\n```text\n所有项目:       session-find\n某台机器:       session-find --machine WIN-DEV\n某台机器某项目: session-find --machine WIN-DEV --project claude-hk\n某项目某系统:   session-find --project claude-hk --os windows\n某台机器某目录: session-find --machine WIN-DEV --slug D--Code-...\n只看导入的:     session-find --source import\n只看本机的:     session-find --source local\n```\n\n## 验收标准\n\n1. 代理模式 trace 写入 `traces/{machine}/{project}/{os}/{slug}/` 分层目录。\n2. `session-import` 能从外部目录导入 traces 并正确放到分层结构中。\n3. 导入的 trace 标记 `source = 'import'`，本机产生的标记 `source = 'local'`。\n4. `session-find` 按任意维度组合查询正常。\n5. 同一 session_id 不会重复导入（幂等）。\n6. Claude Code 的 `~/.claude/` 目录内容未被修改。\n\n## 功能需求补全\n\n### 功能 1：Session 只读索引\n\nSession 索引模块默认只读扫描 Claude Code 原始 session，不主动修改 `~/.claude/`。\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 扫描本机 Claude session 文件。\n2. 解析 session_id、时间、cwd、slug、project、branch。\n3. 写入本地索引库。\n4. 重复扫描必须幂等。\n5. 无法解析的文件进入 skipped 列表并记录原因。\n\n### 功能 2：Trace 与 Session 关联\n\n代理产生的 trace 需要能和 session 建立关联。\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. trace 中存在 session_id 时直接关联。\n2. trace 中没有 session_id 时，使用 cwd、时间窗口、project 做弱关联。\n3. 查询时要区分强关联和弱关联。\n4. 关联失败不影响 trace 保存。\n\n### 功能 3：外部导入\n\n支持从其他机器导入 trace/session 数据。\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 支持完整目录导入。\n2. 支持单个 JSONL 文件导入。\n3. 支持指定 `--machine`、`--project`、`--os`、`--slug`。\n4. 同 session_id 默认跳过，`--force` 才覆盖。\n5. 导入数据必须标记 `source=import`。\n\n### 功能 4：Session 查询\n\n提供多维查询：\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --project claude-hk\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --machine WIN-DEV\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --session abc123\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --branch feature-a\nclaude-tap-plus session-find --source import\n```\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session/source 查询。\n2. 支持表格输出和 JSON 输出。\n3. 查询结果必须显示原始路径、trace 路径、来源机器。\n4. 不存在结果时给出可用筛选建议。\n\n## 功能时序图\n\n### session-collect\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus\n    participant Session as Session 索引\n    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录\n    participant Trace as Trace 存储\n    participant DB as 索引库\n\n    User->>CLI: session-collect\n    CLI->>Session: 启动只读扫描\n    Session->>ClaudeDir: 扫描 session JSONL\n    Session->>Trace: 扫描本地 trace\n    Session->>Session: 解析并关联 session/trace\n    Session->>DB: upsert 索引记录\n    DB-->>Session: 返回写入统计\n    Session-->>CLI: 返回 collected/skipped\n    CLI-->>User: 输出扫描结果\n```\n\n### session-import/find\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus\n    participant Session as Session 索引\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant DB as 索引库\n\n    alt 导入\n        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径\n        CLI->>Session: 请求导入\n        Session->>Storage: 复制到标准目录\n        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入统计\n    else 查询\n        User->>CLI: session-find 条件\n        CLI->>Session: 请求查询\n        Session->>DB: 查询索引\n        DB-->>Session: 返回结果\n        Session-->>CLI: 格式化输出\n    end\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_076107964059491b9332e8ff","duration_ms":9}
