[2026-05-24 21:29:20] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\07-sandbox.md","content":"# 模块 7：Sandbox 工作区与 Tool Adapter\n\n> 阶段：M6（独立，可并行开发） | 依赖：Git\n\n## 目标\n\n基于 Git Worktree 的虚拟工作区系统，为不同工具（Claude Code、Cursor、Trae、IDEA）创建独立视图，实现文件系统隔离、分支隔离和工具隔离。\n\n## 核心对象\n\n| 对象 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| Project | 一个真实 Git 项目，用 git remote/root path 识别 |\n| Sandbox | 一个隔离工作区，通常对应一个 issue 或任务 |\n| Branch | Sandbox 绑定的 Git 分支 |\n| Worktree | Sandbox 的真实文件目录 |\n\n## 功能\n\n### 功能 1：Sandbox 自动准备\n\n用户显式指定 sandbox 时，系统必须查找或创建对应 worktree。\n\n1. 当前目录用于识别项目。\n2. sandbox 名称默认同时作为 branch 名。\n3. sandbox 不存在时自动创建。\n4. sandbox 已存在时复用。\n5. 创建只影响 worktree 目录和 sandbox 元数据，不修改主项目源代码。\n\n### 功能 2：Tool Adapter 透传\n\n根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。\n\n1. `--tool claude` 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code。\n2. `--tool cursor` 打开 worktree。\n3. `--tool idea` 打开 worktree。\n4. `--tool trae` 打开 worktree。\n5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的终端。\n6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具。\n\n### 功能 3：Sandbox 执行命令\n\n支持在 sandbox 内执行命令。\n\n1. 命令 cwd 必须是 sandbox worktree。\n2. 注入 sandbox 环境变量。\n3. 记录命令、开始时间、结束时间、退出码。\n4. 不自动应用修改到主项目。\n\n### 功能 4：Sandbox 同步与应用\n\n同步需要分层，不允许自动覆盖用户主项目。\n\n1. fetch — 只拉远端信息。\n2. pull — 更新 sandbox，需要确认。\n3. push — 推送 sandbox branch，需要显式执行。\n4. apply — 从 sandbox 更新主项目，需要先展示 diff 并确认。\n\n### 功能 5：Sandbox 状态查询\n\n1. 显示 sandbox、branch、worktree、工具启动记录。\n2. 显示 Git dirty 状态。\n3. 显示 worktree 是否缺失。\n4. 支持健康检查和修复建议。\n\n## 本地文件保护规则\n\n**强规则：agent 不直接修改用户当前主项目目录的本地文件。**\n\n允许自动修改：sandbox worktree 内的文件、元数据、日志。\n\n不允许自动修改：主项目根目录源代码、未指定的 sandbox、未经确认的 Git 操作。\n\n主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。\n\n## MVP 边界\n\n**支持**：一个沙箱对应一个 Git worktree、IDEA/Cursor/Claude Code/Trae 打开 worktree、执行命令、状态管理。\n\n**暂不支持**：虚拟文件系统挂载、自动强杀 IDE 进程、自动合并有未提交修改的 worktree、Session resume。\n"},"tool_response":{"type":"update","filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\07-sandbox.md","content":"# 模块 7：Sandbox 工作区与 Tool Adapter\n\n> 阶段：M6（独立，可并行开发） | 依赖：Git\n\n## 目标\n\n基于 Git Worktree 的虚拟工作区系统，为不同工具（Claude Code、Cursor、Trae、IDEA）创建独立视图，实现文件系统隔离、分支隔离和工具隔离。\n\n## 核心对象\n\n| 对象 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| Project | 一个真实 Git 项目，用 git remote/root path 识别 |\n| Sandbox | 一个隔离工作区，通常对应一个 issue 或任务 |\n| Branch | Sandbox 绑定的 Git 分支 |\n| Worktree | Sandbox 的真实文件目录 |\n\n## 功能\n\n### 功能 1：Sandbox 自动准备\n\n用户显式指定 sandbox 时，系统必须查找或创建对应 worktree。\n\n1. 当前目录用于识别项目。\n2. sandbox 名称默认同时作为 branch 名。\n3. sandbox 不存在时自动创建。\n4. sandbox 已存在时复用。\n5. 创建只影响 worktree 目录和 sandbox 元数据，不修改主项目源代码。\n\n### 功能 2：Tool Adapter 透传\n\n根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。\n\n1. `--tool claude` 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code。\n2. `--tool cursor` 打开 worktree。\n3. `--tool idea` 打开 worktree。\n4. `--tool trae` 打开 worktree。\n5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的终端。\n6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具。\n\n### 功能 3：Sandbox 执行命令\n\n支持在 sandbox 内执行命令。\n\n1. 命令 cwd 必须是 sandbox worktree。\n2. 注入 sandbox 环境变量。\n3. 记录命令、开始时间、结束时间、退出码。\n4. 不自动应用修改到主项目。\n\n### 功能 4：Sandbox 同步与应用\n\n同步需要分层，不允许自动覆盖用户主项目。\n\n1. fetch — 只拉远端信息。\n2. pull — 更新 sandbox，需要确认。\n3. push — 推送 sandbox branch，需要显式执行。\n4. apply — 从 sandbox 更新主项目，需要先展示 diff 并确认。\n\n### 功能 5：Sandbox 状态查询\n\n1. 显示 sandbox、branch、worktree、工具启动记录。\n2. 显示 Git dirty 状态。\n3. 显示 worktree 是否缺失。\n4. 支持健康检查和修复建议。\n\n## 本地文件保护规则\n\n**强规则：agent 不直接修改用户当前主项目目录的本地文件。**\n\n允许自动修改：sandbox worktree 内的文件、元数据、日志。\n\n不允许自动修改：主项目根目录源代码、未指定的 sandbox、未经确认的 Git 操作。\n\n主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。\n\n## MVP 边界\n\n**支持**：一个沙箱对应一个 Git worktree、IDEA/Cursor/Claude Code/Trae 打开 worktree、执行命令、状态管理。\n\n**暂不支持**：虚拟文件系统挂载、自动强杀 IDE 进程、自动合并有未提交修改的 worktree、Session resume。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":314,"newStart":1,"newLines":47,"lines":[" # 模块 7：Sandbox 工作区与 Tool Adapter"," "," > 阶段：M6（独立，可并行开发） | 依赖：Git","-> 来源于统一需求 §12-§15","-> 2026-05-24 更新：移除 session resume/orphaned/heartbeat 相关机制，Sandbox 纯粹管理 worktree 和工具启动。"," "," ## 目标"," "," 基于 Git Worktree 的虚拟工作区系统，为不同工具（Claude Code、Cursor、Trae、IDEA）创建独立视图，实现文件系统隔离、分支隔离和工具隔离。"," ","-## 7.1 核心对象关系","+## 核心对象"," ","-```text","-Project","-  -> Sandbox","-      -> Git Branch","-      -> Git Worktree","-      -> Tool 启动记录","-          -> Claude Code","-          -> Cursor","-          -> IDEA","-          -> Trae","-```","-"," | 对象 | 说明 |","-| --- | --- |","+|------|------|"," | Project | 一个真实 Git 项目，用 git remote/root path 识别 |"," | Sandbox | 一个隔离工作区，通常对应一个 issue 或任务 |"," | Branch | Sandbox 绑定的 Git 分支 |"," | Worktree | Sandbox 的真实文件目录 |"," ","-## 7.2 可行方案","+## 功能"," ","-| 方案 | 隔离级别 | 复杂度 | 适用判断 |","-| --- | --- | --- | --- |","-| Git Worktree | 分支级 | 低 | **MVP 选择**，稳定、原生、IDE 兼容性最好 |","-| OverlayFS / Union Mount | 文件级 | 中 | Linux/WSL 场景 |","-| FUSE / WinFsp / Dokan | 完全虚拟 | 高 | 后续高级能力 |","-| Btrfs/ZFS/LVM 快照 | 完整副本 | 中 | 快速复制工作区 |","-| 容器/WSL Namespace | 进程级 | 中到高 | CLI 和构建任务 |","-","-## 7.3 Sandbox 命令","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox init","-claude_tap_plus sandbox create <name> [--branch <branch>] [--from <base>]","-claude_tap_plus sandbox list","-claude_tap_plus sandbox status [<name>]","-claude_tap_plus sandbox open <name> --tool <claude|cursor|trae|idea|cmd>","-claude_tap_plus sandbox cd <name>","-claude_tap_plus sandbox exec <name> -- <command>","-claude_tap_plus sandbox sync <name>","-claude_tap_plus sandbox stop <name>","-claude_tap_plus sandbox remove <name> [--keep-branch]","-claude_tap_plus sandbox doctor","-```","-","-### sandbox init","-","-1. 检查当前目录是否为 Git 仓库。","-2. 创建 `.worktrees` 目录。","-3. 创建 `.claude-tap-plus/sandboxes.json`。","-4. 检测 `git`、`claude`、`cursor`、`idea64.exe`、`trae` 是否可用。","-5. 记录当前项目根目录和项目标识。","-","-生成结构：","-","-```text","-project/","-  .git/","-  .worktrees/","-  .claude-tap-plus/","-    sandboxes.json","-    logs/","-```","-","-### sandbox create","-","-从当前分支创建：","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox create feature-a","-```","-","-从指定基线创建：","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox create feature-a --from main","-```","-","-绑定已有分支：","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox create hotfix-123 --branch hotfix-123","-```","-","-内部执行：","-","-```cmd","-git fetch --all --prune","-git worktree add .worktrees\\feature-a -b feature-a main","-```","-","-状态写入 `sandboxes.json`：","-","-```json","-{","-  \"name\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"worktree\": \"D:\\\\...\\\\.worktrees\\\\feature-a\",","-  \"base_branch\": \"main\",","-  \"status\": \"ready\",","-  \"created_at\": \"2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00\"","-}","-```","-","-### sandbox open","-","-| 工具 | 等价行为 |","-| --- | --- |","-| `--tool claude` | `cd /d .worktrees\\<name> && claude` |","-| `--tool cursor` | `cursor .worktrees\\<name>` |","-| `--tool trae` | `trae .worktrees\\<name>` |","-| `--tool idea` | `idea64.exe .worktrees\\<name>` |","-| `--tool cmd` | `cmd /k cd /d .worktrees\\<name>` |","-","-`open` 时记录工具启动信息到 `sandboxes.json`：","-","-```json","-{","-  \"name\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"tools\": {","-    \"claude\": { \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T10:30:00+08:00\" },","-    \"idea\": { \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00\" }","-  }","-}","-```","-","-### sandbox cd","-","-CMD 无法让子进程修改父 CMD 的 cwd，因此输出目标路径：","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox cd feature-a","-:: 输出: D:\\...\\feature-a","-","-for /f \"delims=\" %i in ('claude_tap_plus sandbox cd feature-a') do cd /d \"%i\"","-```","-","-### sandbox exec","-","-在 sandbox worktree 内执行命令，注入环境变量：","-","-```cmd","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_SANDBOX=feature-a","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_PROJECT=claude-hk","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_WORKTREE=D:\\...\\feature-a","-```","-","-### sandbox doctor","-","-检查项：","-","-1. 当前目录是否为 Git 仓库。","-2. `.worktrees` 是否存在。","-3. `sandboxes.json` 是否可读写。","-4. Git worktree 记录是否和本地目录一致。","-5. 是否有已删除但未 prune 的 worktree。","-6. `claude`、`cursor`、`idea64.exe`、`trae` 是否在 PATH 中。","-","-支持 `--fix` 自动修复（如 `git worktree prune`）。","-","-## 7.4 Tool Adapter 透传机制","-","-### 命令形态","-","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus --sandbox <branch> --tool <tool> [tool-args...]","-```","-","-### 命令解析","-","-`claude-tap-plus` 只消费自己的参数，剩余部分透传给 tool adapter：","-","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus --sandbox feature-a --tool claude","-```","-","-### Adapter 映射","-","-| tool | 用户命令 | 实际命令 |","-| --- | --- | --- |","-| claude | （无参数） | 进入 worktree 后执行 `claude` |","-| cursor | （无参数） | `cursor <worktree>` |","-| idea | （无参数） | `idea64.exe <worktree>` |","-| trae | （无参数） | `trae <worktree>` |","-| cmd | （无参数） | `cmd /k cd /d <worktree>` |","-","-### Sandbox 自动创建规则","-","-当 `--sandbox <branch>` 指定但 sandbox 不存在时：","-","-1. 本地已有分支：`git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> <branch>`","-2. 仅远端有：`git fetch && git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> -b <branch> origin/<branch>`","-3. 都没有：`git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> -b <branch>`","-","-自动创建只创建隔离 worktree，不修改主项目根目录文件。","-","-## 7.5 本地文件保护规则","-","-**强规则：agent 不直接修改用户当前主项目目录的本地文件。**","-","-允许自动修改：","-","-1. `.worktrees\\<sandbox>` 内的 sandbox 文件。","-2. `.claude-tap-plus` 内的元数据、日志。","-3. Git worktree 必需的 Git 元数据。","-","-不允许自动修改：","-","-1. 当前主项目根目录下的源代码文件。","-2. 用户未指定的其他 sandbox。","-3. 未经确认的 Git branch 合并、rebase、reset。","-4. 未经确认的从 sandbox 覆盖回主项目根目录。","-","-显式同步命令：","-","-```cmd","-claude_tap_plus sandbox diff feature-a        # 查看变更","-claude_tap_plus sandbox apply feature-a       # 应用到主项目","-claude_tap_plus sandbox sync feature-a --to-local  # 同步到本地","-```","-","-## 7.6 同步分层","-","-| 同步层 | 内容 | 是否自动 |","-| --- | --- | --- |","-| Git Fetch | 拉取远端分支信息 | 可自动 fetch，不自动合并 |","-| Sandbox Update | 更新 sandbox worktree | 需要用户确认 |","-| Apply To Local | 从 sandbox 更新主项目 | 必须用户显式执行 |","-| Push Remote | 推送 sandbox 分支 | 必须用户显式执行 |","-","-## 7.7 Agent 工作环境变量","-","-```cmd","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_PROJECT=claude-hk","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_SANDBOX=feature-a","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_BRANCH=feature-a","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_WORKTREE=D:\\...\\.worktrees\\feature-a","-CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_TOOL=claude","-```","-","-## 7.8 MVP 边界","-","-**MVP 支持：**","-","-1. 一个沙箱对应一个 Git worktree。","-2. IDEA、Cursor、Claude Code、Trae 打开真实 worktree 路径。","-3. `exec` 命令在 worktree 内执行。","-4. `status/list/doctor/remove` 管理沙箱生命周期。","-5. `--sandbox`、`--tool` 参数。","-","-**MVP 暂不支持：**","-","-1. 同一个绝对路径在不同工具里显示不同内容。","-2. FUSE/WinFsp 虚拟挂载。","-3. 自动强杀 IDE 进程。","-4. 自动合并或 rebase 有未提交修改的 worktree。","-5. Session resume 或 orphaned session 接管。","-","-## 功能需求补全","-"," ### 功能 1：Sandbox 自动准备"," "," 用户显式指定 sandbox 时，系统必须查找或创建对应 worktree。"," ","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus --sandbox feature-a --tool claude","-```","-","-功能要求：","-"," 1. 当前目录用于识别项目。","-2. `--sandbox` 值默认同时作为 branch 名。","+2. sandbox 名称默认同时作为 branch 名。"," 3. sandbox 不存在时自动创建。"," 4. sandbox 已存在时复用。","-5. 创建只影响 `.worktrees/<sandbox>` 和 sandbox 元数据，不修改主项目源代码。","+5. 创建只影响 worktree 目录和 sandbox 元数据，不修改主项目源代码。"," "," ### 功能 2：Tool Adapter 透传"," ","-Tool Adapter 根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。","+根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。"," ","-功能要求：","-"," 1. `--tool claude` 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code。"," 2. `--tool cursor` 打开 worktree。"," 3. `--tool idea` 打开 worktree。"," 4. `--tool trae` 打开 worktree。","-5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD。","-6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具或 adapter。","+5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的终端。","+6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具。"," "," ### 功能 3：Sandbox 执行命令"," ","-支持在 sandbox 内执行命令：","+支持在 sandbox 内执行命令。"," ","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus sandbox exec feature-a -- npm test","-```","-","-功能要求：","-"," 1. 命令 cwd 必须是 sandbox worktree。"," 2. 注入 sandbox 环境变量。"," 3. 记录命令、开始时间、结束时间、退出码。"]},{"oldStart":318,"oldLines":83,"newStart":51,"newLines":30,"lines":[" "," 同步需要分层，不允许自动覆盖用户主项目。"," ","-功能要求：","+1. fetch — 只拉远端信息。","+2. pull — 更新 sandbox，需要确认。","+3. push — 推送 sandbox branch，需要显式执行。","+4. apply — 从 sandbox 更新主项目，需要先展示 diff 并确认。"," ","-1. `sync --fetch` 只拉远端信息。","-2. `sync --pull` 更新 sandbox，需要确认。","-3. `sync --push` 推送 sandbox branch，需要显式执行。","-4. `apply` 从 sandbox 更新主项目，需要先展示 diff。","-5. 主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。","-"," ### 功能 5：Sandbox 状态查询"," ","-提供状态查询：","-","-```cmd","-claude-tap-plus sandbox list","-claude-tap-plus sandbox status feature-a","-claude-tap-plus sandbox doctor","-```","-","-功能要求：","-"," 1. 显示 sandbox、branch、worktree、工具启动记录。"," 2. 显示 Git dirty 状态。"," 3. 显示 worktree 是否缺失。","-4. doctor 能提示修复建议。","+4. 支持健康检查和修复建议。"," ","-## 功能时序图","+## 本地文件保护规则"," ","-### 打开工具","+**强规则：agent 不直接修改用户当前主项目目录的本地文件。**"," ","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus","-    participant Sandbox as Sandbox 管理","-    participant Git as Git","-    participant Adapter as Tool Adapter","-    participant Tool as 目标工具","-    participant Meta as Sandbox 元数据","+允许自动修改：sandbox worktree 内的文件、元数据、日志。"," ","-    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool idea","-    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a","-    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree","-    alt 不存在","-        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree","-    else 已存在","-        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree","-    end","-    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 状态","-    CLI->>Adapter: 选择 idea adapter","-    Adapter->>Tool: 打开 worktree","-    Adapter->>Meta: 记录工具启动","-    Tool-->>User: 展示 sandbox 项目","-```","+不允许自动修改：主项目根目录源代码、未指定的 sandbox、未经确认的 Git 操作。"," ","-### 执行与应用","+主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。"," ","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus","-    participant Sandbox as Sandbox 管理","-    participant Worktree as Sandbox Worktree","-    participant Main as 主项目目录","-    participant Meta as 元数据","+## MVP 边界"," ","-    User->>CLI: sandbox exec feature-a -- test command","-    CLI->>Sandbox: 定位 worktree","-    Sandbox->>Worktree: 在 sandbox 内执行命令","-    Worktree-->>Sandbox: 返回退出码","-    Sandbox->>Meta: 记录命令日志","-    User->>CLI: sandbox apply feature-a","-    CLI->>Sandbox: 生成 diff","-    Sandbox-->>User: 展示变更摘要并要求确认","-    alt 用户确认","-        Sandbox->>Main: 应用 sandbox 变更","-        Sandbox->>Meta: 记录 apply","-    else 用户取消","-        Sandbox->>Meta: 记录取消","-    end","-```","+**支持**：一个沙箱对应一个 Git worktree、IDEA/Cursor/Claude Code/Trae 打开 worktree、执行命令、状态管理。","+","+**暂不支持**：虚拟文件系统挂载、自动强杀 IDE 进程、自动合并有未提交修改的 worktree、Session resume。"]}],"originalFile":"# 模块 7：Sandbox 工作区与 Tool Adapter\n\n> 阶段：M6（独立，可并行开发） | 依赖：Git\n> 来源于统一需求 §12-§15\n> 2026-05-24 更新：移除 session resume/orphaned/heartbeat 相关机制，Sandbox 纯粹管理 worktree 和工具启动。\n\n## 目标\n\n基于 Git Worktree 的虚拟工作区系统，为不同工具（Claude Code、Cursor、Trae、IDEA）创建独立视图，实现文件系统隔离、分支隔离和工具隔离。\n\n## 7.1 核心对象关系\n\n```text\nProject\n  -> Sandbox\n      -> Git Branch\n      -> Git Worktree\n      -> Tool 启动记录\n          -> Claude Code\n          -> Cursor\n          -> IDEA\n          -> Trae\n```\n\n| 对象 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project | 一个真实 Git 项目，用 git remote/root path 识别 |\n| Sandbox | 一个隔离工作区，通常对应一个 issue 或任务 |\n| Branch | Sandbox 绑定的 Git 分支 |\n| Worktree | Sandbox 的真实文件目录 |\n\n## 7.2 可行方案\n\n| 方案 | 隔离级别 | 复杂度 | 适用判断 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Git Worktree | 分支级 | 低 | **MVP 选择**，稳定、原生、IDE 兼容性最好 |\n| OverlayFS / Union Mount | 文件级 | 中 | Linux/WSL 场景 |\n| FUSE / WinFsp / Dokan | 完全虚拟 | 高 | 后续高级能力 |\n| Btrfs/ZFS/LVM 快照 | 完整副本 | 中 | 快速复制工作区 |\n| 容器/WSL Namespace | 进程级 | 中到高 | CLI 和构建任务 |\n\n## 7.3 Sandbox 命令\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox init\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox create <name> [--branch <branch>] [--from <base>]\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox list\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox status [<name>]\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox open <name> --tool <claude|cursor|trae|idea|cmd>\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox cd <name>\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox exec <name> -- <command>\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox sync <name>\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox stop <name>\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox remove <name> [--keep-branch]\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox doctor\n```\n\n### sandbox init\n\n1. 检查当前目录是否为 Git 仓库。\n2. 创建 `.worktrees` 目录。\n3. 创建 `.claude-tap-plus/sandboxes.json`。\n4. 检测 `git`、`claude`、`cursor`、`idea64.exe`、`trae` 是否可用。\n5. 记录当前项目根目录和项目标识。\n\n生成结构：\n\n```text\nproject/\n  .git/\n  .worktrees/\n  .claude-tap-plus/\n    sandboxes.json\n    logs/\n```\n\n### sandbox create\n\n从当前分支创建：\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox create feature-a\n```\n\n从指定基线创建：\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox create feature-a --from main\n```\n\n绑定已有分支：\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox create hotfix-123 --branch hotfix-123\n```\n\n内部执行：\n\n```cmd\ngit fetch --all --prune\ngit worktree add .worktrees\\feature-a -b feature-a main\n```\n\n状态写入 `sandboxes.json`：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"worktree\": \"D:\\\\...\\\\.worktrees\\\\feature-a\",\n  \"base_branch\": \"main\",\n  \"status\": \"ready\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00\"\n}\n```\n\n### sandbox open\n\n| 工具 | 等价行为 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `--tool claude` | `cd /d .worktrees\\<name> && claude` |\n| `--tool cursor` | `cursor .worktrees\\<name>` |\n| `--tool trae` | `trae .worktrees\\<name>` |\n| `--tool idea` | `idea64.exe .worktrees\\<name>` |\n| `--tool cmd` | `cmd /k cd /d .worktrees\\<name>` |\n\n`open` 时记录工具启动信息到 `sandboxes.json`：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"claude\": { \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T10:30:00+08:00\" },\n    \"idea\": { \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T10:00:00+08:00\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### sandbox cd\n\nCMD 无法让子进程修改父 CMD 的 cwd，因此输出目标路径：\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox cd feature-a\n:: 输出: D:\\...\\feature-a\n\nfor /f \"delims=\" %i in ('claude_tap_plus sandbox cd feature-a') do cd /d \"%i\"\n```\n\n### sandbox exec\n\n在 sandbox worktree 内执行命令，注入环境变量：\n\n```cmd\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_SANDBOX=feature-a\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_PROJECT=claude-hk\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_WORKTREE=D:\\...\\feature-a\n```\n\n### sandbox doctor\n\n检查项：\n\n1. 当前目录是否为 Git 仓库。\n2. `.worktrees` 是否存在。\n3. `sandboxes.json` 是否可读写。\n4. Git worktree 记录是否和本地目录一致。\n5. 是否有已删除但未 prune 的 worktree。\n6. `claude`、`cursor`、`idea64.exe`、`trae` 是否在 PATH 中。\n\n支持 `--fix` 自动修复（如 `git worktree prune`）。\n\n## 7.4 Tool Adapter 透传机制\n\n### 命令形态\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus --sandbox <branch> --tool <tool> [tool-args...]\n```\n\n### 命令解析\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 只消费自己的参数，剩余部分透传给 tool adapter：\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus --sandbox feature-a --tool claude\n```\n\n### Adapter 映射\n\n| tool | 用户命令 | 实际命令 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| claude | （无参数） | 进入 worktree 后执行 `claude` |\n| cursor | （无参数） | `cursor <worktree>` |\n| idea | （无参数） | `idea64.exe <worktree>` |\n| trae | （无参数） | `trae <worktree>` |\n| cmd | （无参数） | `cmd /k cd /d <worktree>` |\n\n### Sandbox 自动创建规则\n\n当 `--sandbox <branch>` 指定但 sandbox 不存在时：\n\n1. 本地已有分支：`git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> <branch>`\n2. 仅远端有：`git fetch && git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> -b <branch> origin/<branch>`\n3. 都没有：`git worktree add .worktrees\\<branch> -b <branch>`\n\n自动创建只创建隔离 worktree，不修改主项目根目录文件。\n\n## 7.5 本地文件保护规则\n\n**强规则：agent 不直接修改用户当前主项目目录的本地文件。**\n\n允许自动修改：\n\n1. `.worktrees\\<sandbox>` 内的 sandbox 文件。\n2. `.claude-tap-plus` 内的元数据、日志。\n3. Git worktree 必需的 Git 元数据。\n\n不允许自动修改：\n\n1. 当前主项目根目录下的源代码文件。\n2. 用户未指定的其他 sandbox。\n3. 未经确认的 Git branch 合并、rebase、reset。\n4. 未经确认的从 sandbox 覆盖回主项目根目录。\n\n显式同步命令：\n\n```cmd\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox diff feature-a        # 查看变更\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox apply feature-a       # 应用到主项目\nclaude_tap_plus sandbox sync feature-a --to-local  # 同步到本地\n```\n\n## 7.6 同步分层\n\n| 同步层 | 内容 | 是否自动 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Git Fetch | 拉取远端分支信息 | 可自动 fetch，不自动合并 |\n| Sandbox Update | 更新 sandbox worktree | 需要用户确认 |\n| Apply To Local | 从 sandbox 更新主项目 | 必须用户显式执行 |\n| Push Remote | 推送 sandbox 分支 | 必须用户显式执行 |\n\n## 7.7 Agent 工作环境变量\n\n```cmd\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_PROJECT=claude-hk\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_SANDBOX=feature-a\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_BRANCH=feature-a\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_WORKTREE=D:\\...\\.worktrees\\feature-a\nCLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_TOOL=claude\n```\n\n## 7.8 MVP 边界\n\n**MVP 支持：**\n\n1. 一个沙箱对应一个 Git worktree。\n2. IDEA、Cursor、Claude Code、Trae 打开真实 worktree 路径。\n3. `exec` 命令在 worktree 内执行。\n4. `status/list/doctor/remove` 管理沙箱生命周期。\n5. `--sandbox`、`--tool` 参数。\n\n**MVP 暂不支持：**\n\n1. 同一个绝对路径在不同工具里显示不同内容。\n2. FUSE/WinFsp 虚拟挂载。\n3. 自动强杀 IDE 进程。\n4. 自动合并或 rebase 有未提交修改的 worktree。\n5. Session resume 或 orphaned session 接管。\n\n## 功能需求补全\n\n### 功能 1：Sandbox 自动准备\n\n用户显式指定 sandbox 时，系统必须查找或创建对应 worktree。\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus --sandbox feature-a --tool claude\n```\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 当前目录用于识别项目。\n2. `--sandbox` 值默认同时作为 branch 名。\n3. sandbox 不存在时自动创建。\n4. sandbox 已存在时复用。\n5. 创建只影响 `.worktrees/<sandbox>` 和 sandbox 元数据，不修改主项目源代码。\n\n### 功能 2：Tool Adapter 透传\n\nTool Adapter 根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. `--tool claude` 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code。\n2. `--tool cursor` 打开 worktree。\n3. `--tool idea` 打开 worktree。\n4. `--tool trae` 打开 worktree。\n5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD。\n6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具或 adapter。\n\n### 功能 3：Sandbox 执行命令\n\n支持在 sandbox 内执行命令：\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus sandbox exec feature-a -- npm test\n```\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 命令 cwd 必须是 sandbox worktree。\n2. 注入 sandbox 环境变量。\n3. 记录命令、开始时间、结束时间、退出码。\n4. 不自动应用修改到主项目。\n\n### 功能 4：Sandbox 同步与应用\n\n同步需要分层，不允许自动覆盖用户主项目。\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. `sync --fetch` 只拉远端信息。\n2. `sync --pull` 更新 sandbox，需要确认。\n3. `sync --push` 推送 sandbox branch，需要显式执行。\n4. `apply` 从 sandbox 更新主项目，需要先展示 diff。\n5. 主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。\n\n### 功能 5：Sandbox 状态查询\n\n提供状态查询：\n\n```cmd\nclaude-tap-plus sandbox list\nclaude-tap-plus sandbox status feature-a\nclaude-tap-plus sandbox doctor\n```\n\n功能要求：\n\n1. 显示 sandbox、branch、worktree、工具启动记录。\n2. 显示 Git dirty 状态。\n3. 显示 worktree 是否缺失。\n4. doctor 能提示修复建议。\n\n## 功能时序图\n\n### 打开工具\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus\n    participant Sandbox as Sandbox 管理\n    participant Git as Git\n    participant Adapter as Tool Adapter\n    participant Tool as 目标工具\n    participant Meta as Sandbox 元数据\n\n    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool idea\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a\n    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree\n    alt 不存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree\n    else 已存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree\n    end\n    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 状态\n    CLI->>Adapter: 选择 idea adapter\n    Adapter->>Tool: 打开 worktree\n    Adapter->>Meta: 记录工具启动\n    Tool-->>User: 展示 sandbox 项目\n```\n\n### 执行与应用\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as claude-tap-plus\n    participant Sandbox as Sandbox 管理\n    participant Worktree as Sandbox Worktree\n    participant Main as 主项目目录\n    participant Meta as 元数据\n\n    User->>CLI: sandbox exec feature-a -- test command\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 定位 worktree\n    Sandbox->>Worktree: 在 sandbox 内执行命令\n    Worktree-->>Sandbox: 返回退出码\n    Sandbox->>Meta: 记录命令日志\n    User->>CLI: sandbox apply feature-a\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 生成 diff\n    Sandbox-->>User: 展示变更摘要并要求确认\n    alt 用户确认\n        Sandbox->>Main: 应用 sandbox 变更\n        Sandbox->>Meta: 记录 apply\n    else 用户取消\n        Sandbox->>Meta: 记录取消\n    end\n```\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_454b912534514aa2ac1d740d","duration_ms":17}
