[2026-05-24 21:29:57] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\09-module-functional-design.md","content":"# 模块 9：模块功能设计\n\n> 设计范围：基于 01-08 模块文档整理的功能设计总览。\n> 只描述功能和模块关系，不涉及具体实现。\n\n## 总体定位\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具，围绕 Claude Code 提供以下能力：\n\n1. 记录 AI Agent API 调用和 token 用量。\n2. 固定保存 trace、session、issue、sandbox 元数据。\n3. 支持跨机器查找 session 和 trace。\n4. 支持 GitHub Issue 本地镜像和开发闭环。\n5. 支持 Git Worktree Sandbox，隔离不同分支和工具工作区。\n6. 支持多工具打开同一个 sandbox。\n7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改。\n\n## 功能清单\n\n| 功能 | 作用 | 用户价值 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 固定本地存储 | 统一所有数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |\n| 项目身份识别 | 统一 project identity | 所有模块用同一身份关联数据 |\n| Proxy Trace | 代理 API 请求并记录 | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |\n| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |\n| Usage 统计 | 归一化 token 用量 | 按项目、session、sandbox 统计成本 |\n| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 session | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |\n| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 session | 保留现有 push/pull/status 能力 |\n| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |\n| Hooks Guard | 关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim |\n| Skill Integration | 给 skill 提供状态查询 | claim/fix/pr 流程更可靠 |\n| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale/blocked issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |\n| Sandbox | Git Worktree 隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |\n| Tool Adapter | 多工具启动到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |\n| 审计日志 | 记录命令、动作、阻断、同步 | 出问题时可追踪 |\n\n## 模块划分\n\n| 模块 | 作用 | 依赖 |\n|------|------|------|\n| CLI Router | 所有命令入口，参数解析与分发 | 无 |\n| Project Resolver | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 无 |\n| Storage Manager | 管理固定存储根目录，为各模块分配路径 | 无 |\n| Proxy Trace | 启动本地代理，转发请求，记录 trace | Project、Storage、SSE、Usage、Trace |\n| SSE Reassembler | 解析 SSE chunk，重组 streaming 响应 | 无 |\n| Usage Normalizer | 统一多 provider token 字段 | 无 |\n| Trace Writer | 写入 JSONL trace，附加上下文元数据 | Storage |\n| Session Index | 只读扫描、导入、查询 session/trace | Storage、DB |\n| Session Snapshot | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session | Storage |\n| Issue Mirror | 同步 GitHub Issue，提供查询和看板 | DB |\n| Hooks Guard | 操作前规则检查，返回 allow/warn/block | Issue Mirror |\n| Skill Integration | 为 issue skill 提供状态查询和决策 | Issue Mirror、Hooks Guard |\n| Scheduler | 定时治理 stale、blocked、in-progress | Issue Mirror |\n| Sandbox Manager | 管理 Git Worktree sandbox | Storage、Git |\n| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD | Sandbox |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox | Storage、Git |\n\n## 模块关系\n\n- CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。\n- Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。\n- Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。\n- Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。\n- Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。\n- Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。\n- Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。\n- Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。\n\n## 数据流转原则\n\n1. **自动写入**：trace、metadata、local db、sandbox 元数据可自动写入 `~/.claude-tap`。\n2. **只读扫描**：session-collect 只读 `~/.claude/`，不写回。\n3. **显式触发**：session-pull、sandbox apply/sync、GitHub 更新必须用户显式执行。\n4. **禁止自动修改**：主项目源代码、Claude 原始 session 目录不能被 agent 自动修改。\n\n## 模块优先级\n\n| 优先级 | 模块 | 原因 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P0 | Project Resolver + Storage Manager | 所有模块的基础依赖 |\n| P0 | CLI 参数模型 | 后续新参数会和现有透传冲突 |\n| P1 | Proxy Trace | 当前核心可用能力 |\n| P1 | Session Index | 支撑跨机器查找 |\n| P1 | Sandbox + Tool Adapter | 支撑隔离工作区 |\n| P2 | Issue Mirror | 支撑 issue 闭环 |\n| P2 | Hooks Guard + Skill Integration | 依赖 Issue Mirror |\n| P3 | Scheduler | 依赖 Issue Mirror 稳定 |\n| P3 | Sync | 依赖 storage/index schema 稳定 |\n\n## 设计边界\n\n**MVP 支持**：固定存储、Proxy trace、Usage 统计、Session 查询与快照、Sandbox worktree、多工具 adapter、Issue Mirror 查询、Hooks/Skill 基础检查。\n\n**MVP 不支持**：虚拟文件系统、自动修改主项目源代码、自动合并/rebase/reset、企业级权限、实时多人协作。\n"},"tool_response":{"type":"update","filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\09-module-functional-design.md","content":"# 模块 9：模块功能设计\n\n> 设计范围：基于 01-08 模块文档整理的功能设计总览。\n> 只描述功能和模块关系，不涉及具体实现。\n\n## 总体定位\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具，围绕 Claude Code 提供以下能力：\n\n1. 记录 AI Agent API 调用和 token 用量。\n2. 固定保存 trace、session、issue、sandbox 元数据。\n3. 支持跨机器查找 session 和 trace。\n4. 支持 GitHub Issue 本地镜像和开发闭环。\n5. 支持 Git Worktree Sandbox，隔离不同分支和工具工作区。\n6. 支持多工具打开同一个 sandbox。\n7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改。\n\n## 功能清单\n\n| 功能 | 作用 | 用户价值 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 固定本地存储 | 统一所有数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |\n| 项目身份识别 | 统一 project identity | 所有模块用同一身份关联数据 |\n| Proxy Trace | 代理 API 请求并记录 | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |\n| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |\n| Usage 统计 | 归一化 token 用量 | 按项目、session、sandbox 统计成本 |\n| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 session | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |\n| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 session | 保留现有 push/pull/status 能力 |\n| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |\n| Hooks Guard | 关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim |\n| Skill Integration | 给 skill 提供状态查询 | claim/fix/pr 流程更可靠 |\n| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale/blocked issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |\n| Sandbox | Git Worktree 隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |\n| Tool Adapter | 多工具启动到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |\n| 审计日志 | 记录命令、动作、阻断、同步 | 出问题时可追踪 |\n\n## 模块划分\n\n| 模块 | 作用 | 依赖 |\n|------|------|------|\n| CLI Router | 所有命令入口，参数解析与分发 | 无 |\n| Project Resolver | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 无 |\n| Storage Manager | 管理固定存储根目录，为各模块分配路径 | 无 |\n| Proxy Trace | 启动本地代理，转发请求，记录 trace | Project、Storage、SSE、Usage、Trace |\n| SSE Reassembler | 解析 SSE chunk，重组 streaming 响应 | 无 |\n| Usage Normalizer | 统一多 provider token 字段 | 无 |\n| Trace Writer | 写入 JSONL trace，附加上下文元数据 | Storage |\n| Session Index | 只读扫描、导入、查询 session/trace | Storage、DB |\n| Session Snapshot | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session | Storage |\n| Issue Mirror | 同步 GitHub Issue，提供查询和看板 | DB |\n| Hooks Guard | 操作前规则检查，返回 allow/warn/block | Issue Mirror |\n| Skill Integration | 为 issue skill 提供状态查询和决策 | Issue Mirror、Hooks Guard |\n| Scheduler | 定时治理 stale、blocked、in-progress | Issue Mirror |\n| Sandbox Manager | 管理 Git Worktree sandbox | Storage、Git |\n| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD | Sandbox |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox | Storage、Git |\n\n## 模块关系\n\n- CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。\n- Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。\n- Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。\n- Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。\n- Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。\n- Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。\n- Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。\n- Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。\n\n## 数据流转原则\n\n1. **自动写入**：trace、metadata、local db、sandbox 元数据可自动写入 `~/.claude-tap`。\n2. **只读扫描**：session-collect 只读 `~/.claude/`，不写回。\n3. **显式触发**：session-pull、sandbox apply/sync、GitHub 更新必须用户显式执行。\n4. **禁止自动修改**：主项目源代码、Claude 原始 session 目录不能被 agent 自动修改。\n\n## 模块优先级\n\n| 优先级 | 模块 | 原因 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P0 | Project Resolver + Storage Manager | 所有模块的基础依赖 |\n| P0 | CLI 参数模型 | 后续新参数会和现有透传冲突 |\n| P1 | Proxy Trace | 当前核心可用能力 |\n| P1 | Session Index | 支撑跨机器查找 |\n| P1 | Sandbox + Tool Adapter | 支撑隔离工作区 |\n| P2 | Issue Mirror | 支撑 issue 闭环 |\n| P2 | Hooks Guard + Skill Integration | 依赖 Issue Mirror |\n| P3 | Scheduler | 依赖 Issue Mirror 稳定 |\n| P3 | Sync | 依赖 storage/index schema 稳定 |\n\n## 设计边界\n\n**MVP 支持**：固定存储、Proxy trace、Usage 统计、Session 查询与快照、Sandbox worktree、多工具 adapter、Issue Mirror 查询、Hooks/Skill 基础检查。\n\n**MVP 不支持**：虚拟文件系统、自动修改主项目源代码、自动合并/rebase/reset、企业级权限、实时多人协作。\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":880,"newStart":1,"newLines":95,"lines":["-# claude-tap-plus 模块功能设计","+# 模块 9：模块功能设计"," ","-> 设计范围：基于 `claude-tap-plus-modules/` 文件夹内现有需求文档整理。","-> 设计目标：只描述功能、模块、关系、数据流转、时序图，不展开具体代码实现。","+> 设计范围：基于 01-08 模块文档整理的功能设计总览。","+> 只描述功能和模块关系，不涉及具体实现。"," ","-## 1. 总体定位","+## 总体定位"," ","-`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具。它围绕 Claude Code 的真实使用场景，提供 API 代理追踪、Session 索引、Issue 状态镜像、Hooks/Skill 护栏、Sandbox 工作区、Tool Adapter 和同步治理能力。","+`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具，围绕 Claude Code 提供以下能力："," ","-核心目标：","-"," 1. 记录 AI Agent API 调用和 token 用量。"," 2. 固定保存 trace、session、issue、sandbox 元数据。"," 3. 支持跨机器查找 session 和 trace。"," 4. 支持 GitHub Issue 本地镜像和开发闭环。"," 5. 支持 Git Worktree Sandbox，隔离不同分支和工具工作区。","-6. 支持 Claude、Cursor、IDEA、Trae、CMD 等工具打开同一个 sandbox。","-7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改，只有用户显式同步或 apply 才能更新。","+6. 支持多工具打开同一个 sandbox。","+7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改。"," ","-## 2. 功能清单","+## 功能清单"," "," | 功能 | 作用 | 用户价值 |","-| --- | --- | --- |","-| 固定本地存储 | 统一 trace、session、db、log、sandbox 元数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |","-| 项目身份识别 | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 所有模块用同一项目身份关联数据 |","-| Proxy Trace | 代理 Claude API 请求并记录 JSONL trace | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |","-| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组成完整消息 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |","+|------|------|---------|","+| 固定本地存储 | 统一所有数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |","+| 项目身份识别 | 统一 project identity | 所有模块用同一身份关联数据 |","+| Proxy Trace | 代理 API 请求并记录 | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |","+| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |"," | Usage 统计 | 归一化 token 用量 | 按项目、session、sandbox 统计成本 |","-| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 Claude session 和 trace | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |","-| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session 文件 | 保留现有 session-push/pull/status 能力 |","-| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue 状态 | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |","-| Hooks Guard | 在关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim、PR 前置缺失 |","-| Skill Integration | 给 issue skill 提供结构化状态查询 | claim/fix/pr/test/review 流程更可靠 |","-| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale、blocked、in-progress issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |","-| Sandbox | 用 Git Worktree 创建隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |","-| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD 到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |","-| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox 改动 | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |","-| 审计日志 | 记录命令、模块动作、阻断、同步结果 | 出问题时可追踪 |","+| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 session | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |","+| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 session | 保留现有 push/pull/status 能力 |","+| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |","+| Hooks Guard | 关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim |","+| Skill Integration | 给 skill 提供状态查询 | claim/fix/pr 流程更可靠 |","+| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale/blocked issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |","+| Sandbox | Git Worktree 隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |","+| Tool Adapter | 多工具启动到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |","+| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |","+| 审计日志 | 记录命令、动作、阻断、同步 | 出问题时可追踪 |"," ","-## 3. 模块划分","+## 模块划分"," ","-### 3.1 CLI Router 模块","+| 模块 | 作用 | 依赖 |","+|------|------|------|","+| CLI Router | 所有命令入口，参数解析与分发 | 无 |","+| Project Resolver | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 无 |","+| Storage Manager | 管理固定存储根目录，为各模块分配路径 | 无 |","+| Proxy Trace | 启动本地代理，转发请求，记录 trace | Project、Storage、SSE、Usage、Trace |","+| SSE Reassembler | 解析 SSE chunk，重组 streaming 响应 | 无 |","+| Usage Normalizer | 统一多 provider token 字段 | 无 |","+| Trace Writer | 写入 JSONL trace，附加上下文元数据 | Storage |","+| Session Index | 只读扫描、导入、查询 session/trace | Storage、DB |","+| Session Snapshot | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session | Storage |","+| Issue Mirror | 同步 GitHub Issue，提供查询和看板 | DB |","+| Hooks Guard | 操作前规则检查，返回 allow/warn/block | Issue Mirror |","+| Skill Integration | 为 issue skill 提供状态查询和决策 | Issue Mirror、Hooks Guard |","+| Scheduler | 定时治理 stale、blocked、in-progress | Issue Mirror |","+| Sandbox Manager | 管理 Git Worktree sandbox | Storage、Git |","+| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD | Sandbox |","+| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox | Storage、Git |"," ","-作用：","+## 模块关系"," ","-1. 作为所有命令入口。","-2. 解析参数。","-3. 区分 proxy、session、issue、sandbox、tool、sync 等模式。","-4. 把请求分发到对应模块。","+- CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。","+- Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。","+- Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。","+- Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。","+- Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。","+- Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。","+- Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。","+- Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。"," ","-输入：","+## 数据流转原则"," ","-```text","-用户命令、cwd、环境变量","-```","+1. **自动写入**：trace、metadata、local db、sandbox 元数据可自动写入 `~/.claude-tap`。","+2. **只读扫描**：session-collect 只读 `~/.claude/`，不写回。","+3. **显式触发**：session-pull、sandbox apply/sync、GitHub 更新必须用户显式执行。","+4. **禁止自动修改**：主项目源代码、Claude 原始 session 目录不能被 agent 自动修改。"," ","-输出：","+## 模块优先级"," ","-```text","-模块调用请求、命令执行结果","-```","+| 优先级 | 模块 | 原因 |","+|--------|------|------|","+| P0 | Project Resolver + Storage Manager | 所有模块的基础依赖 |","+| P0 | CLI 参数模型 | 后续新参数会和现有透传冲突 |","+| P1 | Proxy Trace | 当前核心可用能力 |","+| P1 | Session Index | 支撑跨机器查找 |","+| P1 | Sandbox + Tool Adapter | 支撑隔离工作区 |","+| P2 | Issue Mirror | 支撑 issue 闭环 |","+| P2 | Hooks Guard + Skill Integration | 依赖 Issue Mirror |","+| P3 | Scheduler | 依赖 Issue Mirror 稳定 |","+| P3 | Sync | 依赖 storage/index schema 稳定 |"," ","-### 3.2 Project Resolver 模块","+## 设计边界"," ","-作用：","+**MVP 支持**：固定存储、Proxy trace、Usage 统计、Session 查询与快照、Sandbox worktree、多工具 adapter、Issue Mirror 查询、Hooks/Skill 基础检查。"," ","-1. 识别当前项目身份。","-2. 解析 git root、remote repo、branch、cwd、slug。","-3. 为 trace/session/issue/sandbox 提供统一 project identity。","-","-输出数据：","-","-```json","-{","-  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",","-  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",","-  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",","-  \"branch\": \"main\",","-  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",","-  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",","-  \"os\": \"windows\",","-  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\"","-}","-```","-","-### 3.3 Storage Manager 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 管理固定存储根目录。","-2. 为各模块分配 trace、session、db、logs、imports、exports 路径。","-3. 做存储健康检查。","-","-目录模型：","-","-```text","-~/.claude-tap/","-  config/","-  db/","-  traces/","-  sessions/","-  sandboxes/","-  logs/","-  imports/","-  exports/","-```","-","-### 3.4 Proxy Trace 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 启动本地 API reverse proxy。","-2. 转发 Claude Code API 请求。","-3. 记录请求、响应、耗时、状态码。","-4. 调用 SSE Reassembler 和 Usage 模块。","-","-依赖：","-","-```text","-Project Resolver","-Storage Manager","-SSE Reassembler","-Usage Normalizer","-Trace Writer","-```","-","-### 3.5 SSE Reassembler 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 解析 SSE chunk。","-2. 将 streaming 内容重组成完整响应。","-3. 标记重组状态：complete、partial、failed。","-","-### 3.6 Usage Normalizer 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 统一不同 provider 的 token 字段。","-2. 输出 input、output、cache read、cache create 等统计。","-3. 支持后续按 project/session/sandbox/date 聚合。","-","-### 3.7 Trace Writer 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 写入 JSONL trace。","-2. 附加 project、machine、branch、sandbox、tool、session 元数据。","-3. 输出运行结束 summary。","-","-### 3.8 Session 模块","-","-Session 模块分两类能力。","-","-#### Session Index","-","-作用：","-","-1. 只读扫描 Claude 原始 session。","-2. 导入外部 trace/session。","-3. 建立 session 查询索引。","-4. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session 查询。","-","-#### Session Snapshot","-","-作用：","-","-1. 保留 `session-push`。","-2. 保留 `session-pull`。","-3. 保留 `session-status`。","-4. 明确 `session-pull` 会写 Claude 原始目录，必须显式触发。","-","-### 3.9 Issue Mirror 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 同步 GitHub Issue 到本地数据库。","-2. 提供 issue 查询、ready 列表、blocked 列表、board。","-3. 记录 issue activity。","-","-输出：","-","-```text","-issues、dependencies、activity_log、board view","-```","-","-### 3.10 Hooks Guard 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 接收 Claude Code hooks 请求。","-2. 查询 Git、Issue Mirror、Sandbox 状态。","-3. 返回 allow、warn、block。","-","-典型规则：","-","-1. 禁止 main 分支直接编辑。","-2. claim 前检查 issue 状态。","-3. PR 前检查 rebase、Test Plan、issue 状态。","-4. destructive Git 操作前阻断或提醒。","-","-### 3.11 Skill Integration 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 为 issue claim/fix/pr/test/review skill 提供本地 API。","-2. 返回结构化决策。","-3. 将 skill 执行结果写入 activity log。","-","-### 3.12 Scheduler 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 定时扫描 issue 状态。","-2. 生成治理计划。","-3. dry-run 输出计划。","-4. 执行 stale、release、blocked/unblocked 等动作。","-","-### 3.13 Sandbox Manager 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 管理 Git Worktree sandbox。","-2. 查找、创建、删除、列出 sandbox。","-3. 查询 sandbox Git 状态。","-4. 提供 diff、apply、sync。","-","-核心规则：","-","-1. `--sandbox <branch>` 指定时，如果不存在就创建。","-2. sandbox 修改只发生在 `.worktrees/<sandbox>`。","-3. 主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。","-","-### 3.14 Tool Adapter 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 根据 `--tool` 启动目标工具。","-2. 把工具启动目录切换到 sandbox worktree。","-3. 透传工具后续命令。","-","-支持工具：","-","-| Tool | 行为 |","-| --- | --- |","-| claude | 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code，可透传 resume/new/reload |","-| cursor | 打开 worktree |","-| idea | 打开 worktree |","-| trae | 打开 worktree |","-| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD |","-","-### 3.15 Sync 模块","-","-作用：","-","-1. 同步 metadata。","-2. 导入/导出 trace 和 session。","-3. fetch/pull/push sandbox 分支。","-4. apply sandbox 修改到主项目。","-","-强规则：","-","-```text","-session/metadata 可自动同步","-git fetch 可自动执行","-sandbox pull/push/apply 必须用户显式触发","-主项目文件不能被 agent 自动修改","-```","-","-## 4. 模块关系","-","-```mermaid","-flowchart TD","-    CLI[CLI Router] --> Project[Project Resolver]","-    CLI --> Storage[Storage Manager]","-    CLI --> Proxy[Proxy Trace]","-    CLI --> Session[Session Module]","-    CLI --> Issue[Issue Mirror]","-    CLI --> Sandbox[Sandbox Manager]","-    CLI --> Tool[Tool Adapter]","-    CLI --> Sync[Sync Module]","-","-    Proxy --> SSE[SSE Reassembler]","-    Proxy --> Usage[Usage Normalizer]","-    Proxy --> Trace[Trace Writer]","-    Trace --> Storage","-    Session --> Storage","-    Session --> DB[(Local DB)]","-","-    Issue --> DB","-    Hooks[Hooks Guard] --> Issue","-    Skills[Skill Integration] --> Issue","-    Scheduler[Scheduler] --> Issue","-    Scheduler --> GitHub[GitHub]","-","-    Sandbox --> Git[Git Worktree]","-    Sandbox --> Storage","-    Tool --> Sandbox","-    Tool --> Apps[Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD]","-    Sync --> Storage","-    Sync --> Git","-```","-","-关系说明：","-","-1. CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。","-2. Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。","-3. Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。","-4. Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。","-5. Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。","-6. Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。","-7. Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。","-8. Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。","-","-## 5. 数据流转","-","-数据流转必须区分“自动流转”和“用户显式触发流转”。默认情况下，`claude-tap-plus` 可以自动写入自己的固定存储、trace、metadata、local db，但不能自动修改主项目源代码，也不能自动写回 Claude 原始 session 目录。","-","-### 5.1 Proxy Trace 数据流","-","-```text","-用户启动 Claude Code","-  -> CLI Router","-  -> Project Resolver 生成 project identity","-  -> Storage Manager 分配 trace/log 路径","-  -> Local Proxy 启动","-  -> Claude Code API 请求进入 Local Proxy","-  -> Local Proxy 转发到 Upstream API","-  -> Upstream API 返回响应","-  -> Local Proxy 处理响应","-      -> streaming 响应进入 SSE Reassembler","-      -> usage 字段进入 Usage Normalizer","-      -> 请求/响应/上下文进入 Trace Writer","-  -> Trace Writer 写入固定存储 traces/","-  -> Usage Summary 在进程退出时输出","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. Proxy Trace 只自动写 `~/.claude-tap` 下的 trace/log。","-2. Proxy Trace 不修改项目源代码。","-3. Proxy Trace 不直接修改 Claude 原始 session。","-","-### 5.2 Session 数据流","-","-Session 分为“只读索引”和“快照同步”两类数据流，二者不能混在一起。","-","-#### 5.2.1 Session Index 只读索引流","-","-```text","-Claude 原始 session","-  -> session-collect 只读扫描","-  -> 解析 session_id/project/machine/os/slug/cwd/branch","-  -> 写入 Local DB 的 Session Index","-  -> session-find 查询","-```","-","-```text","-claude-tap-plus trace","-  -> 解析 trace 中的 session_id/project/sandbox/tool/usage","-  -> 与 Session Index 建立关联","-  -> 写入 Local DB","-  -> session-find / usage 查询","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. `session-collect` 是只读扫描。","-2. 该流程不会写回 `~/.claude/`。","-3. 查询结果只是定位 session/trace，不等于恢复 session。","-","-#### 5.2.2 Session Import 导入流","-","-```text","-外部 trace 或 session 备份","-  -> session-import","-  -> Storage Manager 复制到 imports/ 或 traces/","-  -> 解析 machine/project/os/slug/session_id","-  -> 写入 Local DB，source=import","-  -> session-find 查询","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. import 写入的是 `~/.claude-tap` 固定存储。","-2. import 不写入 Claude 原始目录。","-","-#### 5.2.3 Session Snapshot 快照流","-","-```text","-session-push:","-  Claude 原始 session","-  -> session-push","-  -> 本地快照 sessions/","-  -> session-status","-```","-","-```text","-session-pull:","-  本地快照 sessions/","-  -> 用户显式执行 session-pull","-  -> 写回 Claude 原始 session 目录","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. `session-push` 是备份流。","-2. `session-pull` 是恢复流，必须由用户显式执行。","-3. `session-pull` 会修改 Claude 原始目录，不能作为默认自动行为。","-","-### 5.3 Issue 数据流","-","-```text","-GitHub Issues / PRs / Labels","-  -> 用户触发 sync 或 GitHub webhook","-  -> Issue Mirror 拉取或接收状态","-  -> Local DB","-      -> issues","-      -> issue_dependencies","-      -> activity_log","-  -> /issues /board /ready 查询","-  -> Hooks Guard / Skills / Scheduler 读取本地状态","-```","-","-```text","-用户显式 issue 动作:","-  Skill 或 CLI","-  -> Hooks Guard 检查","-  -> GitHub 更新","-  -> Issue Mirror sync","-  -> Local DB 更新","-```","-","-```text","-Scheduler 动作:","-  Scheduler 生成治理计划","-  -> dry-run 只写 preview log","-  -> execute 模式更新 GitHub","-  -> Issue Mirror sync","-  -> Local DB 更新","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. Hooks Guard 和 Skill 默认只读本地 Issue Mirror。","-2. 修改 GitHub 必须来自用户显式动作，或来自已开启的 Scheduler execute 模式。","-3. 所有 issue 状态变化都应写 activity_log。","-","-### 5.4 Sandbox 数据流","-","-```text","-用户命令 --sandbox branch","-  -> Project Resolver","-  -> Sandbox Manager 查询 sandbox 元数据","-  -> Git 检查 branch/worktree","-  -> sandbox 不存在时创建 .worktrees/<branch>","-  -> Storage Manager 写 sandbox metadata","-  -> Tool Adapter","-  -> Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD 在 worktree 中运行","-  -> sandbox worktree 文件变化","-  -> sandbox status/diff 查询","-```","-","-```text","-用户显式同步:","-  sandbox sync --fetch","-  -> Git fetch 远端信息","-  -> 不修改 sandbox 文件内容","-```","-","-```text","-用户显式更新 sandbox:","-  sandbox sync --pull","-  -> 用户确认","-  -> 更新 sandbox worktree","-  -> 不修改主项目根目录","-```","-","-```text","-用户显式推送:","-  sandbox sync --push","-  -> 推送 sandbox branch 到远端","-  -> 不修改主项目根目录","-```","-","-```text","-用户显式应用到主项目:","-  sandbox apply <name>","-  -> 生成 diff","-  -> 用户确认","-  -> 将 sandbox 变更应用到主项目根目录","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. sandbox 内的工具可以修改 sandbox worktree。","-2. sandbox worktree 与主项目根目录是隔离的。","-3. 主项目根目录只在 `sandbox apply` 或明确的 `sync --to-local` 中被修改。","-4. `fetch/pull/push/apply` 是不同方向的数据流，不能合并成一个默认同步动作。","-","-### 5.5 Tool Adapter 数据流","-","-```text","-用户命令 --tool claude/cursor/idea/trae/cmd","-  -> CLI Router 解析 tool","-  -> Sandbox Manager 返回 worktree","-  -> Tool Adapter 生成工具启动命令","-  -> 注入 CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_* 环境变量","-  -> 目标工具启动","-  -> Tool 启动记录写入 metadata/log","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. Tool Adapter 只负责启动工具和透传参数。","-2. Tool Adapter 不负责自动合并代码。","-3. 是否启用 Proxy Trace 由 tool 类型和命令模式决定。","-","-### 5.6 Sync 数据流","-","-```text","-metadata sync:","-  Local metadata/session index/trace index","-  -> sync metadata","-  -> 外部存储或后端","-```","-","-```text","-import/export:","-  外部目录或远端备份","-  -> import/export","-  -> 固定存储 imports/exports/traces/sessions","-```","-","-```text","-代码同步:","-  Git remote","-  -> fetch/pull/push","-  -> sandbox worktree 或远端 branch","-  -X-> 主项目根目录","-```","-","-说明：","-","-1. metadata sync 可以自动或半自动。","-2. 代码同步必须以 sandbox 为边界。","-3. 任何写主项目根目录的动作都必须显式确认。","-","-## 6. 总体时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as CLI Router","-    participant Project as Project Resolver","-    participant Storage as Storage Manager","-    participant Module as 目标模块","-","-    User->>CLI: 执行 claude-tap-plus 命令","-    CLI->>Project: 识别 project/cwd/git/branch/slug","-    Project-->>CLI: 返回项目身份","-    CLI->>Storage: 获取固定存储路径","-    Storage-->>CLI: 返回 db/trace/session/log 路径","-    CLI->>CLI: 解析命令模式","-    CLI->>Module: 调用目标功能","-    Module-->>CLI: 返回结果","-    CLI-->>User: 输出结果","-```","-","-## 7. Proxy Trace 时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as CLI Router","-    participant Proxy as Proxy Trace","-    participant Claude as Claude Code","-    participant API as 上游 API","-    participant SSE as SSE Reassembler","-    participant Usage as Usage Normalizer","-    participant Trace as Trace Writer","-","-    User->>CLI: claude-tap-plus claude","-    CLI->>Proxy: 启动本地代理","-    CLI->>Claude: 注入代理地址并启动","-    Claude->>Proxy: API 请求","-    Proxy->>API: 转发请求","-    API-->>Proxy: 返回响应/SSE","-    Proxy->>SSE: 如为 streaming 则重组","-    Proxy->>Usage: 归一化 token 用量","-    Proxy->>Trace: 写入 JSONL trace","-    Proxy-->>Claude: 返回响应","-    Claude-->>User: 输出交互内容","-    CLI-->>User: 退出时输出 usage summary","-```","-","-## 8. Session 时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as CLI Router","-    participant Session as Session Module","-    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录","-    participant Storage as 固定存储","-    participant DB as Local DB","-","-    alt session-collect","-        User->>CLI: session-collect","-        CLI->>Session: 扫描 session","-        Session->>ClaudeDir: 只读扫描","-        Session->>DB: 写入索引","-        Session-->>CLI: 返回统计","-    else session-import","-        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径","-        CLI->>Session: 导入外部数据","-        Session->>Storage: 复制到固定目录","-        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import","-        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入结果","-    else session-find","-        User->>CLI: session-find 条件","-        CLI->>Session: 查询","-        Session->>DB: 读取索引","-        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果","-    else session-push/pull/status","-        User->>CLI: session-push/pull/status","-        CLI->>Session: 执行快照功能","-        Session->>ClaudeDir: 读取或写入原始 session","-        Session->>Storage: 读写本地快照","-        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果","-    end","-    CLI-->>User: 展示结果","-```","-","-## 9. Issue 工作流时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户/Agent","-    participant Skill as Skill","-    participant Guard as Hooks Guard","-    participant Issue as Issue Mirror","-    participant DB as Local DB","-    participant GitHub as GitHub","-    participant Log as Activity Log","-","-    User->>Skill: claim/fix/pr/test/review","-    Skill->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态","-    Issue->>DB: 读取本地镜像","-    DB-->>Issue: 返回 issue/依赖/PR","-    Issue-->>Skill: 返回状态","-    Skill->>Guard: 请求操作前检查","-    Guard->>Issue: 查询规则所需状态","-    Issue-->>Guard: 返回状态","-    alt block","-        Guard->>Log: 记录阻断","-        Guard-->>Skill: 返回阻断原因","-    else allow/warn","-        Guard->>Log: 记录通过或提醒","-        Guard-->>Skill: 返回决策","-        Skill->>GitHub: 用户显式动作","-        Skill->>Issue: 写入活动并触发同步","-    end","-```","-","-## 10. Sandbox 与 Tool Adapter 时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as CLI Router","-    participant Project as Project Resolver","-    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Manager","-    participant Git as Git Worktree","-    participant Tool as Tool Adapter","-    participant App as 目标工具","-    participant Meta as Metadata","-","-    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool claude resume session_id","-    CLI->>Project: 识别当前项目","-    Project-->>CLI: 返回 project identity","-    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a sandbox","-    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree","-    alt sandbox 不存在","-        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree","-    else sandbox 已存在","-        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree","-    end","-    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 元数据","-    CLI->>Tool: 选择 claude adapter","-    Tool->>App: 在 worktree 内执行 claude resume session_id","-    Tool->>Meta: 记录工具启动","-    App-->>User: 进入目标工作环境","-```","-","-## 11. Scheduler 时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant Timer as 定时器/用户","-    participant Scheduler as Scheduler","-    participant Issue as Issue Mirror","-    participant DB as Local DB","-    participant GitHub as GitHub","-    participant Log as Activity Log","-","-    Timer->>Scheduler: 触发任务","-    Scheduler->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态","-    Issue->>DB: 读取 issues/activity/dependencies","-    DB-->>Issue: 返回状态","-    Issue-->>Scheduler: 返回候选 issue","-    Scheduler->>Scheduler: 生成治理计划","-    alt dry-run","-        Scheduler->>Log: 记录 preview","-        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出计划","-    else execute","-        Scheduler->>Log: 记录计划动作","-        Scheduler->>GitHub: 执行 label/comment/assign 更新","-        GitHub-->>Scheduler: 返回结果","-        Scheduler->>Issue: 同步最新状态","-        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出执行报告","-    end","-```","-","-## 12. 同步时序图","-","-```mermaid","-sequenceDiagram","-    participant User as 用户","-    participant CLI as CLI Router","-    participant Sync as Sync Module","-    participant Storage as 固定存储","-    participant Git as Git","-    participant Remote as 远端/外部存储","-    participant Main as 主项目目录","-","-    User->>CLI: sync/import/export/apply","-    CLI->>Sync: 请求同步动作","-    alt metadata sync","-        Sync->>Storage: 同步 metadata/session/trace","-        Sync->>Remote: 上传或下载","-    else git fetch","-        Sync->>Git: fetch 远端信息","-    else sandbox pull/push","-        Sync->>Git: 用户显式 pull/push sandbox branch","-    else apply to local","-        Sync->>Git: 生成 sandbox diff","-        Sync-->>User: 展示变更并要求确认","-        User-->>Sync: 确认","-        Sync->>Main: 应用到主项目目录","-    end","-    Sync-->>CLI: 返回同步报告","-    CLI-->>User: 展示结果","-```","-","-## 13. 关键数据对象","-","-### ProjectIdentity","-","-```json","-{","-  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",","-  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",","-  \"os\": \"windows\",","-  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",","-  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",","-  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",","-  \"branch\": \"main\",","-  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\"","-}","-```","-","-### TraceRecord","-","-```json","-{","-  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",","-  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",","-  \"sandbox\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"tool\": \"claude\",","-  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",","-  \"method\": \"POST\",","-  \"path\": \"/v1/messages\",","-  \"status\": 200,","-  \"duration_ms\": 1234,","-  \"usage\": {","-    \"input_tokens\": 1000,","-    \"output_tokens\": 200","-  }","-}","-```","-","-### SessionIndex","-","-```json","-{","-  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",","-  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",","-  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",","-  \"os\": \"windows\",","-  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",","-  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",","-  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"trace_file_path\": \"traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/slug/abc123.jsonl\",","-  \"source\": \"local\"","-}","-```","-","-### SandboxRecord","-","-```json","-{","-  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",","-  \"sandbox\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",","-  \"worktree\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\\\\.worktrees\\\\feature-a\",","-  \"status\": \"ready\",","-  \"tools\": {","-    \"claude\": {","-      \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T17:00:00+08:00\"","-    },","-    \"idea\": {","-      \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T17:10:00+08:00\"","-    }","-  }","-}","-```","-","-### IssueRecord","-","-```json","-{","-  \"number\": 123,","-  \"title\": \"Add sandbox tool adapter\",","-  \"state\": \"open\",","-  \"assignee\": \"user\",","-  \"labels\": [\"in-progress\"],","-  \"blocked\": false,","-  \"pr_number\": 45,","-  \"last_activity_at\": \"2026-05-24T17:00:00+08:00\"","-}","-```","-","-## 14. 模块依赖顺序","-","-| 顺序 | 模块 | 说明 |","-| --- | --- | --- |","-| 1 | CLI Router | 所有功能入口 |","-| 2 | Project Resolver | 所有数据关联基础 |","-| 3 | Storage Manager | 所有持久化基础 |","-| 4 | Proxy Trace / Trace Writer / Usage / SSE | 当前核心能力 |","-| 5 | Session Index / Snapshot | 历史上下文查询与备份 |","-| 6 | Sandbox Manager | Git worktree 工作区 |","-| 7 | Tool Adapter | 多工具启动 |","-| 8 | Issue Mirror | issue 本地状态 |","-| 9 | Hooks Guard / Skill Integration | issue 工作流护栏 |","-| 10 | Scheduler | 后台治理 |","-| 11 | Sync | 跨机器和显式同步 |","-","-## 15. 设计边界","-","-MVP 支持：","-","-1. 固定存储。","-2. Proxy trace。","-3. Usage 统计。","-4. Session 查询与快照。","-5. Sandbox worktree。","-6. Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD tool adapter。","-7. Issue Mirror 查询。","-8. Hooks/Skill 基础检查。","-","-MVP 不支持：","-","-1. 同一绝对路径不同进程看到不同内容。","-2. FUSE/WinFsp 虚拟文件系统。","-3. 自动修改主项目源代码。","-4. 自动合并、rebase、reset。","-5. 企业级权限系统。","-6. 实时多人协作编辑。","+**MVP 不支持**：虚拟文件系统、自动修改主项目源代码、自动合并/rebase/reset、企业级权限、实时多人协作。"]}],"originalFile":"# claude-tap-plus 模块功能设计\n\n> 设计范围：基于 `claude-tap-plus-modules/` 文件夹内现有需求文档整理。\n> 设计目标：只描述功能、模块、关系、数据流转、时序图，不展开具体代码实现。\n\n## 1. 总体定位\n\n`claude-tap-plus` 是一个本地优先的 AI Agent 工作环境管理工具。它围绕 Claude Code 的真实使用场景，提供 API 代理追踪、Session 索引、Issue 状态镜像、Hooks/Skill 护栏、Sandbox 工作区、Tool Adapter 和同步治理能力。\n\n核心目标：\n\n1. 记录 AI Agent API 调用和 token 用量。\n2. 固定保存 trace、session、issue、sandbox 元数据。\n3. 支持跨机器查找 session 和 trace。\n4. 支持 GitHub Issue 本地镜像和开发闭环。\n5. 支持 Git Worktree Sandbox，隔离不同分支和工具工作区。\n6. 支持 Claude、Cursor、IDEA、Trae、CMD 等工具打开同一个 sandbox。\n7. 保证主项目本地文件不会被 agent 自动修改，只有用户显式同步或 apply 才能更新。\n\n## 2. 功能清单\n\n| 功能 | 作用 | 用户价值 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 固定本地存储 | 统一 trace、session、db、log、sandbox 元数据目录 | 任意目录启动都能归档到同一位置 |\n| 项目身份识别 | 识别 project、git root、remote、branch、slug | 所有模块用同一项目身份关联数据 |\n| Proxy Trace | 代理 Claude API 请求并记录 JSONL trace | 可回放、审计、统计 API 调用 |\n| SSE 重组 | 将 streaming 响应重组成完整消息 | trace 中能看到完整输出 |\n| Usage 统计 | 归一化 token 用量 | 按项目、session、sandbox 统计成本 |\n| Session 索引 | 扫描、导入、查询 Claude session 和 trace | 跨机器快速找到历史上下文 |\n| Session 快照 | 备份和恢复 Claude 原始 session 文件 | 保留现有 session-push/pull/status 能力 |\n| Issue Mirror | 本地镜像 GitHub Issue 状态 | hooks、skills、scheduler 可快速查询 |\n| Hooks Guard | 在关键操作前检查规则 | 防止 main 分支编辑、错误 claim、PR 前置缺失 |\n| Skill Integration | 给 issue skill 提供结构化状态查询 | claim/fix/pr/test/review 流程更可靠 |\n| Scheduler | 定期治理 stale、blocked、in-progress issue | 无会话时也能维护 issue 状态 |\n| Sandbox | 用 Git Worktree 创建隔离工作区 | 不同分支、不同任务互不影响 |\n| Tool Adapter | 启动 Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD 到 sandbox | 同一套入口管理不同工具 |\n| Sync | 同步 metadata、trace、session、sandbox 改动 | 支持跨机器和显式本地更新 |\n| 审计日志 | 记录命令、模块动作、阻断、同步结果 | 出问题时可追踪 |\n\n## 3. 模块划分\n\n### 3.1 CLI Router 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 作为所有命令入口。\n2. 解析参数。\n3. 区分 proxy、session、issue、sandbox、tool、sync 等模式。\n4. 把请求分发到对应模块。\n\n输入：\n\n```text\n用户命令、cwd、环境变量\n```\n\n输出：\n\n```text\n模块调用请求、命令执行结果\n```\n\n### 3.2 Project Resolver 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 识别当前项目身份。\n2. 解析 git root、remote repo、branch、cwd、slug。\n3. 为 trace/session/issue/sandbox 提供统一 project identity。\n\n输出数据：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\"\n}\n```\n\n### 3.3 Storage Manager 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 管理固定存储根目录。\n2. 为各模块分配 trace、session、db、logs、imports、exports 路径。\n3. 做存储健康检查。\n\n目录模型：\n\n```text\n~/.claude-tap/\n  config/\n  db/\n  traces/\n  sessions/\n  sandboxes/\n  logs/\n  imports/\n  exports/\n```\n\n### 3.4 Proxy Trace 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 启动本地 API reverse proxy。\n2. 转发 Claude Code API 请求。\n3. 记录请求、响应、耗时、状态码。\n4. 调用 SSE Reassembler 和 Usage 模块。\n\n依赖：\n\n```text\nProject Resolver\nStorage Manager\nSSE Reassembler\nUsage Normalizer\nTrace Writer\n```\n\n### 3.5 SSE Reassembler 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 解析 SSE chunk。\n2. 将 streaming 内容重组成完整响应。\n3. 标记重组状态：complete、partial、failed。\n\n### 3.6 Usage Normalizer 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 统一不同 provider 的 token 字段。\n2. 输出 input、output、cache read、cache create 等统计。\n3. 支持后续按 project/session/sandbox/date 聚合。\n\n### 3.7 Trace Writer 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 写入 JSONL trace。\n2. 附加 project、machine、branch、sandbox、tool、session 元数据。\n3. 输出运行结束 summary。\n\n### 3.8 Session 模块\n\nSession 模块分两类能力。\n\n#### Session Index\n\n作用：\n\n1. 只读扫描 Claude 原始 session。\n2. 导入外部 trace/session。\n3. 建立 session 查询索引。\n4. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session 查询。\n\n#### Session Snapshot\n\n作用：\n\n1. 保留 `session-push`。\n2. 保留 `session-pull`。\n3. 保留 `session-status`。\n4. 明确 `session-pull` 会写 Claude 原始目录，必须显式触发。\n\n### 3.9 Issue Mirror 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 同步 GitHub Issue 到本地数据库。\n2. 提供 issue 查询、ready 列表、blocked 列表、board。\n3. 记录 issue activity。\n\n输出：\n\n```text\nissues、dependencies、activity_log、board view\n```\n\n### 3.10 Hooks Guard 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 接收 Claude Code hooks 请求。\n2. 查询 Git、Issue Mirror、Sandbox 状态。\n3. 返回 allow、warn、block。\n\n典型规则：\n\n1. 禁止 main 分支直接编辑。\n2. claim 前检查 issue 状态。\n3. PR 前检查 rebase、Test Plan、issue 状态。\n4. destructive Git 操作前阻断或提醒。\n\n### 3.11 Skill Integration 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 为 issue claim/fix/pr/test/review skill 提供本地 API。\n2. 返回结构化决策。\n3. 将 skill 执行结果写入 activity log。\n\n### 3.12 Scheduler 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 定时扫描 issue 状态。\n2. 生成治理计划。\n3. dry-run 输出计划。\n4. 执行 stale、release、blocked/unblocked 等动作。\n\n### 3.13 Sandbox Manager 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 管理 Git Worktree sandbox。\n2. 查找、创建、删除、列出 sandbox。\n3. 查询 sandbox Git 状态。\n4. 提供 diff、apply、sync。\n\n核心规则：\n\n1. `--sandbox <branch>` 指定时，如果不存在就创建。\n2. sandbox 修改只发生在 `.worktrees/<sandbox>`。\n3. 主项目根目录只有用户显式 apply/sync 才能被修改。\n\n### 3.14 Tool Adapter 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 根据 `--tool` 启动目标工具。\n2. 把工具启动目录切换到 sandbox worktree。\n3. 透传工具后续命令。\n\n支持工具：\n\n| Tool | 行为 |\n| --- | --- |\n| claude | 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code，可透传 resume/new/reload |\n| cursor | 打开 worktree |\n| idea | 打开 worktree |\n| trae | 打开 worktree |\n| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD |\n\n### 3.15 Sync 模块\n\n作用：\n\n1. 同步 metadata。\n2. 导入/导出 trace 和 session。\n3. fetch/pull/push sandbox 分支。\n4. apply sandbox 修改到主项目。\n\n强规则：\n\n```text\nsession/metadata 可自动同步\ngit fetch 可自动执行\nsandbox pull/push/apply 必须用户显式触发\n主项目文件不能被 agent 自动修改\n```\n\n## 4. 模块关系\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    CLI[CLI Router] --> Project[Project Resolver]\n    CLI --> Storage[Storage Manager]\n    CLI --> Proxy[Proxy Trace]\n    CLI --> Session[Session Module]\n    CLI --> Issue[Issue Mirror]\n    CLI --> Sandbox[Sandbox Manager]\n    CLI --> Tool[Tool Adapter]\n    CLI --> Sync[Sync Module]\n\n    Proxy --> SSE[SSE Reassembler]\n    Proxy --> Usage[Usage Normalizer]\n    Proxy --> Trace[Trace Writer]\n    Trace --> Storage\n    Session --> Storage\n    Session --> DB[(Local DB)]\n\n    Issue --> DB\n    Hooks[Hooks Guard] --> Issue\n    Skills[Skill Integration] --> Issue\n    Scheduler[Scheduler] --> Issue\n    Scheduler --> GitHub[GitHub]\n\n    Sandbox --> Git[Git Worktree]\n    Sandbox --> Storage\n    Tool --> Sandbox\n    Tool --> Apps[Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD]\n    Sync --> Storage\n    Sync --> Git\n```\n\n关系说明：\n\n1. CLI Router 是唯一用户入口。\n2. Project Resolver 和 Storage Manager 是所有模块的基础依赖。\n3. Proxy Trace 负责产生 trace 和 usage 数据。\n4. Session 模块负责 session 查询、导入、快照。\n5. Issue Mirror 是 Hooks、Skills、Scheduler 的状态来源。\n6. Sandbox Manager 负责 worktree 生命周期。\n7. Tool Adapter 依赖 Sandbox Manager 启动目标工具。\n8. Sync 模块处理跨机器、远端、本地显式同步。\n\n## 5. 数据流转\n\n数据流转必须区分“自动流转”和“用户显式触发流转”。默认情况下，`claude-tap-plus` 可以自动写入自己的固定存储、trace、metadata、local db，但不能自动修改主项目源代码，也不能自动写回 Claude 原始 session 目录。\n\n### 5.1 Proxy Trace 数据流\n\n```text\n用户启动 Claude Code\n  -> CLI Router\n  -> Project Resolver 生成 project identity\n  -> Storage Manager 分配 trace/log 路径\n  -> Local Proxy 启动\n  -> Claude Code API 请求进入 Local Proxy\n  -> Local Proxy 转发到 Upstream API\n  -> Upstream API 返回响应\n  -> Local Proxy 处理响应\n      -> streaming 响应进入 SSE Reassembler\n      -> usage 字段进入 Usage Normalizer\n      -> 请求/响应/上下文进入 Trace Writer\n  -> Trace Writer 写入固定存储 traces/\n  -> Usage Summary 在进程退出时输出\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. Proxy Trace 只自动写 `~/.claude-tap` 下的 trace/log。\n2. Proxy Trace 不修改项目源代码。\n3. Proxy Trace 不直接修改 Claude 原始 session。\n\n### 5.2 Session 数据流\n\nSession 分为“只读索引”和“快照同步”两类数据流，二者不能混在一起。\n\n#### 5.2.1 Session Index 只读索引流\n\n```text\nClaude 原始 session\n  -> session-collect 只读扫描\n  -> 解析 session_id/project/machine/os/slug/cwd/branch\n  -> 写入 Local DB 的 Session Index\n  -> session-find 查询\n```\n\n```text\nclaude-tap-plus trace\n  -> 解析 trace 中的 session_id/project/sandbox/tool/usage\n  -> 与 Session Index 建立关联\n  -> 写入 Local DB\n  -> session-find / usage 查询\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. `session-collect` 是只读扫描。\n2. 该流程不会写回 `~/.claude/`。\n3. 查询结果只是定位 session/trace，不等于恢复 session。\n\n#### 5.2.2 Session Import 导入流\n\n```text\n外部 trace 或 session 备份\n  -> session-import\n  -> Storage Manager 复制到 imports/ 或 traces/\n  -> 解析 machine/project/os/slug/session_id\n  -> 写入 Local DB，source=import\n  -> session-find 查询\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. import 写入的是 `~/.claude-tap` 固定存储。\n2. import 不写入 Claude 原始目录。\n\n#### 5.2.3 Session Snapshot 快照流\n\n```text\nsession-push:\n  Claude 原始 session\n  -> session-push\n  -> 本地快照 sessions/\n  -> session-status\n```\n\n```text\nsession-pull:\n  本地快照 sessions/\n  -> 用户显式执行 session-pull\n  -> 写回 Claude 原始 session 目录\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. `session-push` 是备份流。\n2. `session-pull` 是恢复流，必须由用户显式执行。\n3. `session-pull` 会修改 Claude 原始目录，不能作为默认自动行为。\n\n### 5.3 Issue 数据流\n\n```text\nGitHub Issues / PRs / Labels\n  -> 用户触发 sync 或 GitHub webhook\n  -> Issue Mirror 拉取或接收状态\n  -> Local DB\n      -> issues\n      -> issue_dependencies\n      -> activity_log\n  -> /issues /board /ready 查询\n  -> Hooks Guard / Skills / Scheduler 读取本地状态\n```\n\n```text\n用户显式 issue 动作:\n  Skill 或 CLI\n  -> Hooks Guard 检查\n  -> GitHub 更新\n  -> Issue Mirror sync\n  -> Local DB 更新\n```\n\n```text\nScheduler 动作:\n  Scheduler 生成治理计划\n  -> dry-run 只写 preview log\n  -> execute 模式更新 GitHub\n  -> Issue Mirror sync\n  -> Local DB 更新\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. Hooks Guard 和 Skill 默认只读本地 Issue Mirror。\n2. 修改 GitHub 必须来自用户显式动作，或来自已开启的 Scheduler execute 模式。\n3. 所有 issue 状态变化都应写 activity_log。\n\n### 5.4 Sandbox 数据流\n\n```text\n用户命令 --sandbox branch\n  -> Project Resolver\n  -> Sandbox Manager 查询 sandbox 元数据\n  -> Git 检查 branch/worktree\n  -> sandbox 不存在时创建 .worktrees/<branch>\n  -> Storage Manager 写 sandbox metadata\n  -> Tool Adapter\n  -> Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD 在 worktree 中运行\n  -> sandbox worktree 文件变化\n  -> sandbox status/diff 查询\n```\n\n```text\n用户显式同步:\n  sandbox sync --fetch\n  -> Git fetch 远端信息\n  -> 不修改 sandbox 文件内容\n```\n\n```text\n用户显式更新 sandbox:\n  sandbox sync --pull\n  -> 用户确认\n  -> 更新 sandbox worktree\n  -> 不修改主项目根目录\n```\n\n```text\n用户显式推送:\n  sandbox sync --push\n  -> 推送 sandbox branch 到远端\n  -> 不修改主项目根目录\n```\n\n```text\n用户显式应用到主项目:\n  sandbox apply <name>\n  -> 生成 diff\n  -> 用户确认\n  -> 将 sandbox 变更应用到主项目根目录\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. sandbox 内的工具可以修改 sandbox worktree。\n2. sandbox worktree 与主项目根目录是隔离的。\n3. 主项目根目录只在 `sandbox apply` 或明确的 `sync --to-local` 中被修改。\n4. `fetch/pull/push/apply` 是不同方向的数据流，不能合并成一个默认同步动作。\n\n### 5.5 Tool Adapter 数据流\n\n```text\n用户命令 --tool claude/cursor/idea/trae/cmd\n  -> CLI Router 解析 tool\n  -> Sandbox Manager 返回 worktree\n  -> Tool Adapter 生成工具启动命令\n  -> 注入 CLAUDE_TAP_PLUS_* 环境变量\n  -> 目标工具启动\n  -> Tool 启动记录写入 metadata/log\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. Tool Adapter 只负责启动工具和透传参数。\n2. Tool Adapter 不负责自动合并代码。\n3. 是否启用 Proxy Trace 由 tool 类型和命令模式决定。\n\n### 5.6 Sync 数据流\n\n```text\nmetadata sync:\n  Local metadata/session index/trace index\n  -> sync metadata\n  -> 外部存储或后端\n```\n\n```text\nimport/export:\n  外部目录或远端备份\n  -> import/export\n  -> 固定存储 imports/exports/traces/sessions\n```\n\n```text\n代码同步:\n  Git remote\n  -> fetch/pull/push\n  -> sandbox worktree 或远端 branch\n  -X-> 主项目根目录\n```\n\n说明：\n\n1. metadata sync 可以自动或半自动。\n2. 代码同步必须以 sandbox 为边界。\n3. 任何写主项目根目录的动作都必须显式确认。\n\n## 6. 总体时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Storage as Storage Manager\n    participant Module as 目标模块\n\n    User->>CLI: 执行 claude-tap-plus 命令\n    CLI->>Project: 识别 project/cwd/git/branch/slug\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回项目身份\n    CLI->>Storage: 获取固定存储路径\n    Storage-->>CLI: 返回 db/trace/session/log 路径\n    CLI->>CLI: 解析命令模式\n    CLI->>Module: 调用目标功能\n    Module-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    CLI-->>User: 输出结果\n```\n\n## 7. Proxy Trace 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Proxy as Proxy Trace\n    participant Claude as Claude Code\n    participant API as 上游 API\n    participant SSE as SSE Reassembler\n    participant Usage as Usage Normalizer\n    participant Trace as Trace Writer\n\n    User->>CLI: claude-tap-plus claude\n    CLI->>Proxy: 启动本地代理\n    CLI->>Claude: 注入代理地址并启动\n    Claude->>Proxy: API 请求\n    Proxy->>API: 转发请求\n    API-->>Proxy: 返回响应/SSE\n    Proxy->>SSE: 如为 streaming 则重组\n    Proxy->>Usage: 归一化 token 用量\n    Proxy->>Trace: 写入 JSONL trace\n    Proxy-->>Claude: 返回响应\n    Claude-->>User: 输出交互内容\n    CLI-->>User: 退出时输出 usage summary\n```\n\n## 8. Session 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Session as Session Module\n    participant ClaudeDir as Claude 原始目录\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant DB as Local DB\n\n    alt session-collect\n        User->>CLI: session-collect\n        CLI->>Session: 扫描 session\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 只读扫描\n        Session->>DB: 写入索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回统计\n    else session-import\n        User->>CLI: session-import 外部路径\n        CLI->>Session: 导入外部数据\n        Session->>Storage: 复制到固定目录\n        Session->>DB: 写入 source=import\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回导入结果\n    else session-find\n        User->>CLI: session-find 条件\n        CLI->>Session: 查询\n        Session->>DB: 读取索引\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    else session-push/pull/status\n        User->>CLI: session-push/pull/status\n        CLI->>Session: 执行快照功能\n        Session->>ClaudeDir: 读取或写入原始 session\n        Session->>Storage: 读写本地快照\n        Session-->>CLI: 返回结果\n    end\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n\n## 9. Issue 工作流时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户/Agent\n    participant Skill as Skill\n    participant Guard as Hooks Guard\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    User->>Skill: claim/fix/pr/test/review\n    Skill->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取本地镜像\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回 issue/依赖/PR\n    Issue-->>Skill: 返回状态\n    Skill->>Guard: 请求操作前检查\n    Guard->>Issue: 查询规则所需状态\n    Issue-->>Guard: 返回状态\n    alt block\n        Guard->>Log: 记录阻断\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回阻断原因\n    else allow/warn\n        Guard->>Log: 记录通过或提醒\n        Guard-->>Skill: 返回决策\n        Skill->>GitHub: 用户显式动作\n        Skill->>Issue: 写入活动并触发同步\n    end\n```\n\n## 10. Sandbox 与 Tool Adapter 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Project as Project Resolver\n    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Manager\n    participant Git as Git Worktree\n    participant Tool as Tool Adapter\n    participant App as 目标工具\n    participant Meta as Metadata\n\n    User->>CLI: --sandbox feature-a --tool claude resume session_id\n    CLI->>Project: 识别当前项目\n    Project-->>CLI: 返回 project identity\n    CLI->>Sandbox: 查找 feature-a sandbox\n    Sandbox->>Git: 检查 branch/worktree\n    alt sandbox 不存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 创建 worktree\n    else sandbox 已存在\n        Git-->>Sandbox: 返回 worktree\n    end\n    Sandbox->>Meta: 更新 sandbox 元数据\n    CLI->>Tool: 选择 claude adapter\n    Tool->>App: 在 worktree 内执行 claude resume session_id\n    Tool->>Meta: 记录工具启动\n    App-->>User: 进入目标工作环境\n```\n\n## 11. Scheduler 时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Timer as 定时器/用户\n    participant Scheduler as Scheduler\n    participant Issue as Issue Mirror\n    participant DB as Local DB\n    participant GitHub as GitHub\n    participant Log as Activity Log\n\n    Timer->>Scheduler: 触发任务\n    Scheduler->>Issue: 查询 issue 状态\n    Issue->>DB: 读取 issues/activity/dependencies\n    DB-->>Issue: 返回状态\n    Issue-->>Scheduler: 返回候选 issue\n    Scheduler->>Scheduler: 生成治理计划\n    alt dry-run\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录 preview\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出计划\n    else execute\n        Scheduler->>Log: 记录计划动作\n        Scheduler->>GitHub: 执行 label/comment/assign 更新\n        GitHub-->>Scheduler: 返回结果\n        Scheduler->>Issue: 同步最新状态\n        Scheduler-->>Timer: 输出执行报告\n    end\n```\n\n## 12. 同步时序图\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as 用户\n    participant CLI as CLI Router\n    participant Sync as Sync Module\n    participant Storage as 固定存储\n    participant Git as Git\n    participant Remote as 远端/外部存储\n    participant Main as 主项目目录\n\n    User->>CLI: sync/import/export/apply\n    CLI->>Sync: 请求同步动作\n    alt metadata sync\n        Sync->>Storage: 同步 metadata/session/trace\n        Sync->>Remote: 上传或下载\n    else git fetch\n        Sync->>Git: fetch 远端信息\n    else sandbox pull/push\n        Sync->>Git: 用户显式 pull/push sandbox branch\n    else apply to local\n        Sync->>Git: 生成 sandbox diff\n        Sync-->>User: 展示变更并要求确认\n        User-->>Sync: 确认\n        Sync->>Main: 应用到主项目目录\n    end\n    Sync-->>CLI: 返回同步报告\n    CLI-->>User: 展示结果\n```\n\n## 13. 关键数据对象\n\n### ProjectIdentity\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\"\n}\n```\n\n### TraceRecord\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"sandbox\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"tool\": \"claude\",\n  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"method\": \"POST\",\n  \"path\": \"/v1/messages\",\n  \"status\": 200,\n  \"duration_ms\": 1234,\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 1000,\n    \"output_tokens\": 200\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### SessionIndex\n\n```json\n{\n  \"session_id\": \"abc123\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\",\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"trace_file_path\": \"traces/WIN-DEV/claude-hk/windows/slug/abc123.jsonl\",\n  \"source\": \"local\"\n}\n```\n\n### SandboxRecord\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"sandbox\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"branch\": \"feature-a\",\n  \"worktree\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\\\\.worktrees\\\\feature-a\",\n  \"status\": \"ready\",\n  \"tools\": {\n    \"claude\": {\n      \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T17:00:00+08:00\"\n    },\n    \"idea\": {\n      \"last_opened\": \"2026-05-24T17:10:00+08:00\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### IssueRecord\n\n```json\n{\n  \"number\": 123,\n  \"title\": \"Add sandbox tool adapter\",\n  \"state\": \"open\",\n  \"assignee\": \"user\",\n  \"labels\": [\"in-progress\"],\n  \"blocked\": false,\n  \"pr_number\": 45,\n  \"last_activity_at\": \"2026-05-24T17:00:00+08:00\"\n}\n```\n\n## 14. 模块依赖顺序\n\n| 顺序 | 模块 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | CLI Router | 所有功能入口 |\n| 2 | Project Resolver | 所有数据关联基础 |\n| 3 | Storage Manager | 所有持久化基础 |\n| 4 | Proxy Trace / Trace Writer / Usage / SSE | 当前核心能力 |\n| 5 | Session Index / Snapshot | 历史上下文查询与备份 |\n| 6 | Sandbox Manager | Git worktree 工作区 |\n| 7 | Tool Adapter | 多工具启动 |\n| 8 | Issue Mirror | issue 本地状态 |\n| 9 | Hooks Guard / Skill Integration | issue 工作流护栏 |\n| 10 | Scheduler | 后台治理 |\n| 11 | Sync | 跨机器和显式同步 |\n\n## 15. 设计边界\n\nMVP 支持：\n\n1. 固定存储。\n2. Proxy trace。\n3. Usage 统计。\n4. Session 查询与快照。\n5. Sandbox worktree。\n6. Claude/Cursor/IDEA/Trae/CMD tool adapter。\n7. Issue Mirror 查询。\n8. Hooks/Skill 基础检查。\n\nMVP 不支持：\n\n1. 同一绝对路径不同进程看到不同内容。\n2. FUSE/WinFsp 虚拟文件系统。\n3. 自动修改主项目源代码。\n4. 自动合并、rebase、reset。\n5. 企业级权限系统。\n6. 实时多人协作编辑。\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_24e57a629c7645c6aa530502","duration_ms":14}
