[2026-05-24 21:46:20] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\modules\\3.2-project-resolver.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\modules\\3.2-project-resolver.md","content":"# 3.2 Project Resolver 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.2\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 识别当前项目身份。\n2. 解析 git root、remote repo、branch、cwd、slug。\n3. 为 trace/session/issue/sandbox 提供统一 project identity。\n\n## 输出数据\n\n```json\n{\n  \"project\": \"claude-hk\",\n  \"git_root\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"remote\": \"https://github.com/owner/claude-hk.git\",\n  \"branch\": \"main\",\n  \"cwd\": \"D:\\\\CodeDevelopment\\\\CodeProject\\\\claude-hk\",\n  \"slug\": \"D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\",\n  \"os\": \"windows\",\n  \"machine_id\": \"WIN-DEV\"\n}\n```\n","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":25}},"tool_use_id":"call_5b2788b75b3546ce90da5230","duration_ms":10}
