[2026-05-24 21:46:20] [INFO] [PostToolUse] Input: {"session_id":"52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512","transcript_path":"C:\\Users\\Administrator\\.claude\\projects\\D--CodeDevelopment-CodeProject-claude-hk\\52a2b4da-969c-4dbd-8817-07c8178c2512.jsonl","cwd":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk","permission_mode":"acceptEdits","effort":{"level":"medium"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\modules\\3.8-session.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"D:\\CodeDevelopment\\CodeProject\\claude-hk\\doc\\otherDoc\\2026-05-24\\claude-tap-plus-modules\\modules\\3.8-session.md","content":"# 3.8 Session 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.8\n\n## 两类能力\n\n### Session Index\n\n作用：\n\n1. 只读扫描 Claude 原始 session。\n2. 导入外部 trace/session。\n3. 建立 session 查询索引。\n4. 支持按 machine/project/os/slug/branch/session 查询。\n\n### Session Snapshot\n\n作用：\n\n1. 保留 `session-push`。\n2. 保留 `session-pull`。\n3. 保留 `session-status`。\n4. 明确 `session-pull` 会写 Claude 原始目录，必须显式触发。\n","numLines":24,"startLine":1,"totalLines":24}},"tool_use_id":"call_7c5fb71f8ad24a2a9b167326","duration_ms":6}
