 trae | 打开 worktree |\n| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的终端 |\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" # 3.14 Tool Adapter 模块"," ","-> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.14","+> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.14、07-sandbox.md"," "," ## 作用"," "]},{"oldStart":8,"oldLines":12,"newStart":8,"newLines":25,"lines":[" 2. 把工具启动目录切换到 sandbox worktree。"," 3. 透传工具后续命令。"," ","+## 功能","+","+### 功能 1：Tool Adapter 透传","+","+根据 `--tool` 启动对应工具。","+","+1. `--tool claude` 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code。","+2. `--tool cursor` 打开 worktree。","+3. `--tool idea` 打开 worktree。","+4. `--tool trae` 打开 worktree。","+5. `--tool cmd` 打开位于 worktree 的终端。","+6. tool 后续参数原样传给对应工具。","+"," ## 支持工具"," "," | Tool | 行为 |","-| --- | --- |","+|------|------|"," | claude | 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code，可透传 resume/new/reload |"," | cursor | 打开 worktree |"," | idea | 打开 worktree |"," | trae | 打开 worktree |","-| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD |","+| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的终端 |"]}],"originalFile":"# 3.14 Tool Adapter 模块\n\n> 来源于 09-module-functional-design.md §3.14\n\n## 作用\n\n1. 根据 `--tool` 启动目标工具。\n2. 把工具启动目录切换到 sandbox worktree。\n3. 透传工具后续命令。\n\n## 支持工具\n\n| Tool | 行为 |\n| --- | --- |\n| claude | 在 worktree 内启动 Claude Code，可透传 resume/new/reload |\n| cursor | 打开 worktree |\n| idea | 打开 worktree |\n| trae | 打开 worktree |\n| cmd | 打开位于 worktree 的 CMD |\n","userModified":false},"tool_use_id":"call_db3c770267c04024aa6bcc86","duration_ms":17}
